window.MG_LAZY_DATA["data/lazy/owner-courses/a494-56f5b017163d1b0d.json"]={sha256:"56f5b017163d1b0dabc5f1ae7bc8c47535537c9ab9072746ebc7cdabe9c77ad2",value:{"id":"a494","title":"ALMA 大型毫米及次毫米波陣列","titleEn":"Atacama Large Millimeter/submillimeter Array","category":"instruments","kind":"course","status":"guided","contentStatus":"reviewable-educational-curriculum","summary":"從查南托高原的大氣透射出發，建立 ALMA 以 54 座 12 m 與 12 座 7 m 天線、最長 16 km 基線在 0.32–3.6 mm 波段合成孔徑的工程鏈：天線面形與 Ruze 效率、4 K SIS 前端、183 GHz 水汽輻射計相位校正、校正誤差預算、相關器資料流與陣列驗收。","summaryEn":"Starting from atmospheric transmission on the Chajnantor plateau, this course builds the engineering chain by which ALMA synthesises an aperture from 54 twelve-metre and 12 seven-metre antennas on baselines up to 16 km at 0.32–3.6 mm: surface accuracy and Ruze efficiency, 4 K SIS front ends, 183 GHz water-vapour-radiometer phase correction, calibration error budgets, correlator data flow and array acceptance.","scope":"依公開物理原理與官方資料編寫的原創教學；步驟是可驗證的學習任務與假想算例，不是原廠配方、施工圖、設備操作許可或安全程序。數值均為教學假設，需依實際規格重算。","scopeEn":"Original teaching built from public physics and official sources. Steps are verifiable learning tasks and hypothetical exercises, not vendor recipes, construction drawings, operating authorisation or safety procedures. Numbers are teaching assumptions and must be recalculated for real specifications.","subcategory":"optics-facilities-observatories","subcategoryTitle":"大型望遠鏡與重力波觀測站","subcategoryTitleEn":"Large telescopes and gravitational-wave observatories","learningTrack":"optics","learningSubdiscipline":"optics-facilities-observatories","learningTags":["optics","optics-facilities-observatories","radio"],"architectureFamily":"radio","architectureNodes":[["大氣與站址（5000 m）","Atmosphere and site (5000 m)"],["12 m／7 m 天線與面板","12 m and 7 m antennas and panels"],["4 K SIS 前端與 LO 分送","4 K SIS front end and LO distribution"],["183 GHz 水汽輻射計","183 GHz water-vapour radiometers"],["數位化與光纖傳輸","Digitisers and fibre transport"],["AOS 相關器與校正流程","AOS correlator and calibration pipeline"]],"architectureEdges":[[0,1],[1,2],[2,4],[4,5],[3,5],[1,3]],"diagram":{"type":"radio","labels":["大氣與站址（5000 m）","12 m／7 m 天線與面板","4 K SIS 前端與 LO 分送","183 GHz 水汽輻射計","數位化與光纖傳輸"],"labelsEn":["Atmosphere and site (5000 m)","12 m and 7 m antennas and panels","4 K SIS front end and LO distribution","183 GHz water-vapour radiometers","Digitisers and fibre transport"],"original":true,"notToScale":true},"workedExample":{"title":"原創假想算例與邊界","titleEn":"Original hypothetical example and boundaries","text":"Band 7 相干性與靈敏度練習（教學假設）：天線面形 ε = 25 µm，在 λ = 0.87 mm 的 Ruze 效率 η_s = exp[−(4π×0.025/0.87)²] = exp(−0.130) = 0.878。WVR 修正後殘餘路徑 15 µm，相位 RMS σ_φ = 2π×0.015/0.87 = 0.108 rad，相干因子 exp(−0.108²/2) = 0.994，總效率 0.878×0.994 = 0.873。若 WVR 失效、殘餘路徑 100 µm，σ_φ = 0.722 rad，相干因子 exp(−0.261) = 0.770，總效率降為 0.878×0.770 = 0.676。以第 7 單元的 0.104 mJy 熱雜訊為基準，等效靈敏度分別為 0.104/0.873 ≈ 0.119 mJy 與 0.104/0.676 ≈ 0.154 mJy，即失去 WVR 修正使偵測同一源所需的整合時間增加 (0.154/0.119)² ≈ 1.7 倍。數值為教學假設，不代表陣列實際規格。","textEn":"Band 7 coherence and sensitivity exercise (teaching assumptions): with surface error ε = 25 µm the Ruze efficiency at λ = 0.87 mm is η_s = exp[−(4π×0.025/0.87)²] = exp(−0.130) = 0.878. A 15 µm residual path after WVR correction gives phase RMS σ_φ = 2π×0.015/0.87 = 0.108 rad and a coherence factor exp(−0.108²/2) = 0.994, so the total efficiency is 0.878×0.994 = 0.873. If the WVR fails and 100 µm of path remains, σ_φ = 0.722 rad, the coherence factor is exp(−0.261) = 0.770 and the total efficiency falls to 0.878×0.770 = 0.676. Referenced to the 0.104 mJy thermal noise of unit 7, the effective sensitivities are 0.104/0.873 ≈ 0.119 mJy and 0.104/0.676 ≈ 0.154 mJy, so losing the WVR correction multiplies the integration time needed for the same detection by (0.154/0.119)² ≈ 1.7. Values are teaching assumptions, not array specifications.","assumptions":"數值是本課自行設定的教學假設，不代表實機量測、產品額定或操作參數；改變系統邊界後必須重算。","assumptionsEn":"Inputs are teaching assumptions, not measured hardware, product ratings or operating parameters; recalculate after changing the system boundary.","sourceScope":"原創數值練習；來源支援公開原理與設施背景，不宣稱來源提供這組數據。","sourceScopeEn":"Original numerical exercise; sources support public principles and facility context, not these numbers."},"depth":4,"languageCoverage":["zh-TW","en"],"simulationOnly":true,"educationEdition":12,"enrichmentVersion":12,"stages":[{"id":"a494-v12-s1","title":"系統邊界與物理原理","titleEn":"System boundaries and physical principles","description":"本階段聚焦「高原站址與毫米波大氣不透明度」與「干涉成像、角解析度與可回復尺度」：先建立機制與定量模型，再設計驗證並診斷失效。","descriptionEn":"This stage covers \"High site and millimetre-wave atmospheric opacity\" and \"Interferometric imaging, angular resolution and recoverable scales\": build the mechanism and quantitative model first, then design verification and diagnose failures.","steps":[{"id":"a494-v12-01","title":"高原站址與毫米波大氣不透明度：原理與系統邊界","titleEn":"High site and millimetre-wave atmospheric opacity: mechanism and system boundary","estimatedMinutes":20,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-alma-about","v12o-alma-antennas","v12o-eso-alma","v12o-nrao-alma"],"prerequisiteIds":[],"objective":"說明「查南托高原大氣視窗」如何決定ALMA 大型毫米及次毫米波陣列的關鍵性能，並畫出其輸入、輸出與邊界。","objectiveEn":"Explain how “Chajnantor atmospheric window” determines the key performance of “Atacama Large Millimeter/submillimeter Array”, and map its inputs, outputs and boundaries.","instruction":"毫米與次毫米波段的主要吸收體是大氣水汽，其壓力增寬的轉動譜線在 183 GHz、325 GHz 等處形成強吸收帶，帶間才是可觀測的大氣視窗。ALMA 選址在海拔約 5000 m 的查南托高原，可沉降水汽（PWV）中位數約 1 mm，使 0.32–3.6 mm（35–950 GHz）十個接收波段都有可用的透射率。大氣不只吸收訊號，也以自身溫度發射雜訊，因此站址同時決定訊號損失與系統雜訊的下限；這是整個陣列的第一道系統邊界。 師傅任務：以方塊圖畫出能量或訊號通過「查南托高原大氣視窗」的路徑，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由環境或製造決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。","instructionEn":"At millimetre and submillimetre wavelengths the dominant absorber is atmospheric water vapour, whose pressure-broadened rotational lines near 183 GHz and 325 GHz form strong absorption bands; the gaps between them are the observable windows. ALMA sits on the Chajnantor plateau at about 5000 m, where the median precipitable water vapour (PWV) is near 1 mm, so all ten receiver bands between 0.32 and 3.6 mm (35–950 GHz) have usable transmission. The atmosphere not only attenuates the signal but radiates noise at its own temperature, so the site fixes both the signal loss and the noise floor; it is the first system boundary of the array. Mentor task: draw a block diagram of the energy or signal path through “Chajnantor atmospheric window”, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by environment or fabrication, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.","observation":"量級提示：天頂不透明度 τ₀ 時，仰角對應大氣質量 A 的透射率為 exp(−τ₀·A)，天空亮溫 T_sky ≈ T_atm·[1 − exp(−τ₀·A)]。","observationEn":"Order-of-magnitude cue: With zenith opacity τ₀, the transmission at airmass A is exp(−τ₀·A) and the sky brightness is T_sky ≈ T_atm·[1 − exp(−τ₀·A)].","failure":"常見誤解：「只要天線夠大，站址高度對毫米波觀測影響不大。」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在方塊圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。","failureEn":"Common misconception: \"With big enough antennas, site altitude hardly matters at millimetre wavelengths.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your block diagram where it breaks down.","check":"方塊圖標明「查南托高原大氣視窗」的輸入、輸出與邊界；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。","checkEn":"The block diagram shows inputs, outputs and boundaries of “Chajnantor atmospheric window”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.","knowledge":[{"id":"a494-v12-01-k1","title":"高原站址與毫米波大氣不透明度","titleEn":"High site and millimetre-wave atmospheric opacity","text":"毫米與次毫米波段的主要吸收體是大氣水汽，其壓力增寬的轉動譜線在 183 GHz、325 GHz 等處形成強吸收帶，帶間才是可觀測的大氣視窗。ALMA 選址在海拔約 5000 m 的查南托高原，可沉降水汽（PWV）中位數約 1 mm，使 0.32–3.6 mm（35–950 GHz）十個接收波段都有可用的透射率。","textEn":"At millimetre and submillimetre wavelengths the dominant absorber is atmospheric water vapour, whose pressure-broadened rotational lines near 183 GHz and 325 GHz form strong absorption bands; the gaps between them are the observable windows. ALMA sits on the Chajnantor plateau at about 5000 m, where the median precipitable water vapour (PWV) is near 1 mm, so all ten receiver bands between 0.32 and 3.6 mm (35–950 GHz) have usable transmission.","sourceIds":["v12o-alma-about","v12o-alma-antennas","v12o-eso-alma","v12o-nrao-alma"]},{"id":"a494-v12-01-k2","title":"誤解辨析","titleEn":"Misconception check","text":"誤解：只要天線夠大，站址高度對毫米波觀測影響不大。 正確的工程判斷必須回到機制與量級。","textEn":"Misconception: With big enough antennas, site altitude hardly matters at millimetre wavelengths. Sound engineering judgement goes back to mechanism and magnitude.","sourceIds":["v12o-alma-about","v12o-alma-antennas","v12o-eso-alma","v12o-nrao-alma"]}],"quiz":{"question":"關於「高原站址與毫米波大氣不透明度」，下列哪一項敘述正確？","questionEn":"Which statement about \"High site and millimetre-wave atmospheric opacity\" is correct?","options":["只要天線夠大，站址高度對毫米波觀測影響不大。","毫米與次毫米波段的主要吸收體是大氣水汽，其壓力增寬的轉動譜線在 183 GHz、325 GHz 等處形成強吸收帶，帶間才是可觀測的大氣視窗。","基線越長影像品質一定越好，短基線只是備用。"],"optionsEn":["With big enough antennas, site altitude hardly matters at millimetre wavelengths.","At millimetre and submillimetre wavelengths the dominant absorber is atmospheric water vapour, whose pressure-broadened rotational lines near 183 GHz and 325 GHz form strong absorption bands.","Longer baselines always give better images; short baselines are just backup."],"answer":1,"explanation":"毫米與次毫米波段的主要吸收體是大氣水汽，其壓力增寬的轉動譜線在 183 GHz、325 GHz 等處形成強吸收帶，帶間才是可觀測的大氣視窗。 其餘選項是常見誤解。","explanationEn":"At millimetre and submillimetre wavelengths the dominant absorber is atmospheric water vapour, whose pressure-broadened rotational lines near 183 GHz and 325 GHz form strong absorption bands; the gaps between them are the observable windows. The other options are common misconceptions."},"unit":1,"unitFacet":"mechanism","order":1,"sequence":1},{"id":"a494-v12-02","title":"高原站址與毫米波大氣不透明度：定量估算","titleEn":"High site and millimetre-wave atmospheric opacity: quantitative estimate","estimatedMinutes":30,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-alma-about","v12o-alma-antennas","v12o-eso-alma","v12o-nrao-alma"],"prerequisiteIds":["a494-v12-01"],"objective":"以數值模型估算「查南托高原大氣視窗」的關鍵量，並判斷參數改變時結果的方向與幅度。","objectiveEn":"Estimate the key quantities of “Chajnantor atmospheric window” with a numerical model and judge the direction and size of changes when a parameter moves.","instruction":"依下列模型逐步重算：天頂不透明度 τ₀ 時，仰角對應大氣質量 A 的透射率為 exp(−τ₀·A)，天空亮溫 T_sky ≈ T_atm·[1 − exp(−τ₀·A)]。取 345 GHz、PWV = 1 mm 時 τ₀ ≈ 0.15（教學假設）、T_atm = 260 K：天頂透射率 exp(−0.15) = 0.861、T_sky ≈ 36 K；仰角 30°（A = 2）時透射率 0.741、T_sky ≈ 67 K。 師傅任務：保留單位重算一次，再只改變一個輸入（例如增加 10%），預測並計算輸出的變化，說明它是線性、平方或更高次方的關係。","instructionEn":"Recalculate step by step: With zenith opacity τ₀, the transmission at airmass A is exp(−τ₀·A) and the sky brightness is T_sky ≈ T_atm·[1 − exp(−τ₀·A)]. Taking τ₀ ≈ 0.15 at 345 GHz for PWV = 1 mm (teaching assumption) and T_atm = 260 K: zenith transmission exp(−0.15) = 0.861 with T_sky ≈ 36 K; at 30° elevation (A = 2) transmission is 0.741 and T_sky ≈ 67 K. Mentor task: redo the calculation keeping units, then change one input (for example by +10%), predict and compute the output change, and state whether the dependence is linear, quadratic or steeper.","observation":"如何核對：以站址的 183 GHz 水汽輻射計或 225 GHz 傾斜輻射計做天空傾角掃描（sky dip），在數個仰角量天空亮溫並擬合 τ₀；再把擬合值與公開的大氣透射模型（例如 ALMA 所用的 ATM 模型）在同一 PWV 下的預測比較，差異應在 10% 以內，否則檢查輻射計增益校正。","observationEn":"How to cross-check: Perform a sky dip with the site 183 GHz water-vapour radiometer or a 225 GHz tipping radiometer, measuring sky brightness at several elevations and fitting τ₀; then compare the fitted value with a public atmospheric transmission model (such as the ATM model ALMA uses) at the same PWV.","failure":"計算陷阱：單位換算錯誤、把教學假設當成設備規格，或只看結果不檢查數量級，都會讓後續設計判斷失準。","failureEn":"Calculation traps: unit conversion slips, treating teaching assumptions as equipment specifications, or accepting a result without checking its magnitude will mislead later design decisions.","check":"重現模型中的數值（取整誤差在 ±5% 內），並提交一個參數改變後的敏感度計算與物理解釋。","checkEn":"Reproduce the model values (within ±5% rounding) and submit a sensitivity calculation for one changed parameter with a physical explanation.","knowledge":[{"id":"a494-v12-02-k1","title":"定量模型","titleEn":"Quantitative model","text":"天頂不透明度 τ₀ 時，仰角對應大氣質量 A 的透射率為 exp(−τ₀·A)，天空亮溫 T_sky ≈ T_atm·[1 − exp(−τ₀·A)]。取 345 GHz、PWV = 1 mm 時 τ₀ ≈ 0.15（教學假設）、T_atm = 260 K：天頂透射率 exp(−0.15) = 0.861、T_sky ≈ 36 K；仰角 30°（A = 2）時透射率 0.741、T_sky ≈ 67 K。","textEn":"With zenith opacity τ₀, the transmission at airmass A is exp(−τ₀·A) and the sky brightness is T_sky ≈ T_atm·[1 − exp(−τ₀·A)]. Taking τ₀ ≈ 0.15 at 345 GHz for PWV = 1 mm (teaching assumption) and T_atm = 260 K: zenith transmission exp(−0.15) = 0.861 with T_sky ≈ 36 K; at 30° elevation (A = 2) transmission is 0.741 and T_sky ≈ 67 K.","sourceIds":["v12o-alma-about","v12o-alma-antennas","v12o-eso-alma","v12o-nrao-alma"]},{"id":"a494-v12-02-k2","title":"模型邊界","titleEn":"Model boundary","text":"本步數值為教學假設；套用到實際設備前，必須重新取得規格、操作條件與不確定度。","textEn":"These numbers are teaching assumptions; before applying them to real equipment, obtain the actual specifications, operating conditions and uncertainties.","sourceIds":["v12o-alma-about","v12o-alma-antennas","v12o-eso-alma","v12o-nrao-alma"]}],"quiz":{"question":"依「高原站址與毫米波大氣不透明度」的定量模型，下列哪一項敘述成立？","questionEn":"According to the quantitative model for \"High site and millimetre-wave atmospheric opacity\", which statement holds?","options":["接收機冷到 4 K 之後，系統溫度就只剩天空的貢獻。","流量校正用的行星是理想點源，不需要模型。","天頂不透明度 τ₀ 時，仰角對應大氣質量 A 的透射率為 exp(−τ₀·A)，天空亮溫 T_sky ≈ T_atm·[1 − exp(−τ₀·A)]。"],"optionsEn":["Once the receiver is at 4 K, the system temperature is only the sky's contribution.","Planets used for flux calibration are ideal point sources and need no model.","With zenith opacity τ₀, the transmission at airmass A is exp(−τ₀·A) and the sky brightness is T_sky ≈ T_atm·[1 − exp(−τ₀·A)]."],"answer":2,"explanation":"天頂不透明度 τ₀ 時，仰角對應大氣質量 A 的透射率為 exp(−τ₀·A)，天空亮溫 T_sky ≈ T_atm·[1 − exp(−τ₀·A)]。 重算時請保留單位。","explanationEn":"With zenith opacity τ₀, the transmission at airmass A is exp(−τ₀·A) and the sky brightness is T_sky ≈ T_atm·[1 − exp(−τ₀·A)]. Keep units when recalculating."},"unit":1,"unitFacet":"model","order":2,"sequence":2},{"id":"a494-v12-03","title":"高原站址與毫米波大氣不透明度：量測與驗證","titleEn":"High site and millimetre-wave atmospheric opacity: measurement and verification","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-alma-about","v12o-alma-antennas","v12o-eso-alma","v12o-nrao-alma"],"prerequisiteIds":["a494-v12-02"],"objective":"設計一項可重複的量測，驗證「查南托高原大氣視窗」是否符合模型預期，並訂出允收準則。","objectiveEn":"Design a repeatable measurement that verifies whether “Chajnantor atmospheric window” meets the model expectation, and set acceptance criteria.","instruction":"以站址的 183 GHz 水汽輻射計或 225 GHz 傾斜輻射計做天空傾角掃描（sky dip），在數個仰角量天空亮溫並擬合 τ₀；再把擬合值與公開的大氣透射模型（例如 ALMA 所用的 ATM 模型）在同一 PWV 下的預測比較，差異應在 10% 以內，否則檢查輻射計增益校正。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成量測計畫，列出儀器、基準件或參考樣品、步驟、比較對象與允收準則，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。","instructionEn":"Perform a sky dip with the site 183 GHz water-vapour radiometer or a 225 GHz tipping radiometer, measuring sky brightness at several elevations and fitting τ₀; then compare the fitted value with a public atmospheric transmission model (such as the ATM model ALMA uses) at the same PWV. Agreement should be within about 10%, otherwise check the radiometer gain calibration. Mentor task: turn this into a measurement plan listing instruments, reference artefacts or samples, procedure, comparison baseline and acceptance criteria, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.","observation":"注意干擾：若用低海拔站址的 τ₀ 經驗值排程，次毫米波段（Band 9、10）會在 PWV 稍高時完全不透明，觀測資料的訊噪比遠低於預期，且校正源的流量也因透射率估錯而系統性偏低。","observationEn":"Watch for interference: Scheduling with opacity values from a low-altitude site makes the submillimetre bands (Band 9 and 10) fully opaque at slightly elevated PWV; the data arrive with far lower signal-to-noise than planned and the calibrator fluxes are also biased low because transmission was misestimated.","failure":"驗證陷阱：只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄環境條件，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。","failureEn":"Verification traps: a single measurement, no traceable reference, or unrecorded environmental conditions make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.","check":"提交量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格。","checkEn":"Submit the measurement plan: instruments, reference, procedure, acceptance criteria and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail decision rule.","knowledge":[{"id":"a494-v12-03-k1","title":"驗證方法","titleEn":"Verification method","text":"以站址的 183 GHz 水汽輻射計或 225 GHz 傾斜輻射計做天空傾角掃描（sky dip），在數個仰角量天空亮溫並擬合 τ₀；再把擬合值與公開的大氣透射模型（例如 ALMA 所用的 ATM 模型）在同一 PWV 下的預測比較，差異應在 10% 以內，否則檢查輻射計增益校正。","textEn":"Perform a sky dip with the site 183 GHz water-vapour radiometer or a 225 GHz tipping radiometer, measuring sky brightness at several elevations and fitting τ₀; then compare the fitted value with a public atmospheric transmission model (such as the ATM model ALMA uses) at the same PWV. Agreement should be within about 10%, otherwise check the radiometer gain calibration.","sourceIds":["v12o-alma-about","v12o-alma-antennas","v12o-eso-alma","v12o-nrao-alma"]},{"id":"a494-v12-03-k2","title":"允收與不確定度","titleEn":"Acceptance and uncertainty","text":"允收準則必須在量測前訂定，並與擴充不確定度一起陳述；比較基準需可追溯。","textEn":"Acceptance criteria are fixed before measuring and stated together with expanded uncertainty; the comparison reference must be traceable.","sourceIds":["v12o-alma-about","v12o-alma-antennas","v12o-eso-alma","v12o-nrao-alma"]}],"quiz":{"question":"要驗證「高原站址與毫米波大氣不透明度」，下列哪一個做法最恰當？","questionEn":"Which approach best verifies \"High site and millimetre-wave atmospheric opacity\"?","options":["以站址的 183 GHz 水汽輻射計或 225 GHz 傾斜輻射計做天空傾角掃描（sky dip），在數個仰角量天空亮溫並擬合 τ₀。","量測時不必記錄溫度、振動與時間等條件，因為它們不會影響結果。","天線數加倍，靈敏度就恰好加倍。"],"optionsEn":["Perform a sky dip with the site 183 GHz water-vapour radiometer or a 225 GHz tipping radiometer, measuring sky brightness at several elevations and fitting τ₀.","Temperature, vibration and timing need not be recorded because they cannot affect the result.","Doubling the number of antennas exactly doubles the sensitivity."],"answer":0,"explanation":"以站址的 183 GHz 水汽輻射計或 225 GHz 傾斜輻射計做天空傾角掃描（sky dip），在數個仰角量天空亮溫並擬合 τ₀；再把擬合值與公開的大氣透射模型（例如 ALMA 所用的 ATM 模型）在同一 PWV 下的預測比較，差異應在 10% 以內，否則檢查輻射計增益校正。 驗證需要基準、重複性與允收準則。","explanationEn":"Perform a sky dip with the site 183 GHz water-vapour radiometer or a 225 GHz tipping radiometer, measuring sky brightness at several elevations and fitting τ₀; then compare the fitted value with a public atmospheric transmission model (such as the ATM model ALMA uses) at the same PWV. Verification needs a reference, repeatability and acceptance criteria."},"unit":1,"unitFacet":"verification","order":3,"sequence":3},{"id":"a494-v12-04","title":"高原站址與毫米波大氣不透明度：失效診斷","titleEn":"High site and millimetre-wave atmospheric opacity: failure diagnosis","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-alma-about","v12o-alma-antennas","v12o-eso-alma","v12o-nrao-alma"],"prerequisiteIds":["a494-v12-03"],"objective":"從症狀倒推「查南托高原大氣視窗」的失效原因，提出能區分原因的檢查與矯正措施。","objectiveEn":"Work back from symptoms to the failure causes of “Chajnantor atmospheric window” and propose discriminating checks and corrective actions.","instruction":"若用低海拔站址的 τ₀ 經驗值排程，次毫米波段（Band 9、10）會在 PWV 稍高時完全不透明，觀測資料的訊噪比遠低於預期，且校正源的流量也因透射率估錯而系統性偏低。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整個系統的性能、良率或安全。","instructionEn":"Scheduling with opacity values from a low-altitude site makes the submillimetre bands (Band 9 and 10) fully opaque at slightly elevated PWV; the data arrive with far lower signal-to-noise than planned and the calibrator fluxes are also biased low because transmission was misestimated. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-system performance, yield or safety.","observation":"連結機制：大氣不只吸收訊號，也以自身溫度發射雜訊，因此站址同時決定訊號損失與系統雜訊的下限；這是整個陣列的第一道系統邊界。","observationEn":"Link to the mechanism: The atmosphere not only attenuates the signal but radiates noise at its own temperature, so the site fixes both the signal loss and the noise floor; it is the first system boundary of the array.","failure":"誤判風險：若相信「只要天線夠大，站址高度對毫米波觀測影響不大。」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。","failureEn":"Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"With big enough antennas, site altitude hardly matters at millimetre wavelengths.\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.","check":"完成失效樹與矯正措施，並指出哪一項量測能最快確認根因、如何防止再發。","checkEn":"Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement that confirms the root cause fastest, and state how recurrence is prevented.","knowledge":[{"id":"a494-v12-04-k1","title":"失效模式","titleEn":"Failure mode","text":"若用低海拔站址的 τ₀ 經驗值排程，次毫米波段（Band 9、10）會在 PWV 稍高時完全不透明，觀測資料的訊噪比遠低於預期，且校正源的流量也因透射率估錯而系統性偏低。","textEn":"Scheduling with opacity values from a low-altitude site makes the submillimetre bands (Band 9 and 10) fully opaque at slightly elevated PWV; the data arrive with far lower signal-to-noise than planned and the calibrator fluxes are also biased low because transmission was misestimated.","sourceIds":["v12o-alma-about","v12o-alma-antennas","v12o-eso-alma","v12o-nrao-alma"]},{"id":"a494-v12-04-k2","title":"根因確認","titleEn":"Root-cause confirmation","text":"根因必須以可區分的量測確認；只更換零件或放寬參數可能掩蓋問題。","textEn":"Confirm the root cause with a discriminating measurement; merely swapping parts or relaxing limits can mask the problem.","sourceIds":["v12o-alma-about","v12o-alma-antennas","v12o-eso-alma","v12o-nrao-alma"]}],"quiz":{"question":"在「高原站址與毫米波大氣不透明度」出現異常時，下列哪一項判斷最合理？","questionEn":"When \"High site and millimetre-wave atmospheric opacity\" misbehaves, which diagnosis is most reasonable?","options":["所有異常都來自操作人員失誤，系統設計不需要檢討。","若用低海拔站址的 τ₀ 經驗值排程，次毫米波段（Band 9、10）會在 PWV 稍高時完全不透明，觀測資料的訊噪比遠低於預期，且校正源的流量也因透射率估錯而系統性偏低。","基線越長影像品質一定越好，短基線只是備用。"],"optionsEn":["Every anomaly is operator error, so the system design never needs review.","Scheduling with opacity values from a low-altitude site makes the submillimetre bands (Band 9 and 10) fully opaque at slightly elevated PWV.","Longer baselines always give better images; short baselines are just backup."],"answer":1,"explanation":"若用低海拔站址的 τ₀ 經驗值排程，次毫米波段（Band 9、10）會在 PWV 稍高時完全不透明，觀測資料的訊噪比遠低於預期，且校正源的流量也因透射率估錯而系統性偏低。 需以量測區分可能原因。","explanationEn":"Scheduling with opacity values from a low-altitude site makes the submillimetre bands (Band 9 and 10) fully opaque at slightly elevated PWV; the data arrive with far lower signal-to-noise than planned and the calibrator fluxes are also biased low because transmission was misestimated. Discriminate candidate causes by measurement."},"unit":1,"unitFacet":"failure","order":4,"sequence":4},{"id":"a494-v12-05","title":"干涉成像、角解析度與可回復尺度：原理與系統邊界","titleEn":"Interferometric imaging, angular resolution and recoverable scales: mechanism and system boundary","estimatedMinutes":20,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-alma-about","v12o-alma-antennas","v12o-eso-alma","v12o-nrao-alma"],"prerequisiteIds":["a494-v12-04"],"objective":"說明「基線向量與 uv 平面」如何決定ALMA 大型毫米及次毫米波陣列的關鍵性能，並畫出其輸入、輸出與邊界。","objectiveEn":"Explain how “Baseline vectors and the uv plane” determines the key performance of “Atacama Large Millimeter/submillimeter Array”, and map its inputs, outputs and boundaries.","instruction":"干涉儀把每一對天線的相關輸出視為天空亮度分佈的一個空間頻率分量（可見度），空間頻率由基線向量在垂直於視線方向的投影除以波長決定。ALMA 的角解析度由最長基線 B_max 決定，約為 λ/B_max；最大可回復的擴散結構則由最短基線 B_min 決定。50 座 12 m 天線可在 150 m 到 16 km 之間重組，12 座 7 m 天線與 4 座 12 m 全功率天線組成的 Morita 緊湊陣列補足短基線與零基線資訊，使擴散結構的總流量不致流失。 師傅任務：以方塊圖畫出能量或訊號通過「基線向量與 uv 平面」的路徑，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由環境或製造決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。","instructionEn":"An interferometer treats the correlated output of each antenna pair as one spatial-frequency component of the sky brightness (a visibility), with spatial frequency set by the baseline vector projected perpendicular to the line of sight divided by wavelength. ALMA's angular resolution is set by the longest baseline B_max, roughly λ/B_max, while the largest recoverable extended structure is set by the shortest baseline B_min. Fifty 12 m antennas can be reconfigured between 150 m and 16 km, and the Morita compact array of twelve 7 m antennas plus four 12 m total-power antennas supplies short and zero spacings so that the flux of extended emission is not lost. Mentor task: draw a block diagram of the energy or signal path through “Baseline vectors and the uv plane”, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by environment or fabrication, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.","observation":"量級提示：角解析度 θ ≈ λ/B_max：在 345 GHz（λ = 0.87 mm）、B_max = 16 km 時 θ ≈ 0.87×10⁻³/16000 = 5.4×10⁻⁸ rad ≈ 0.011″（11 毫角秒）；12 m 天線的主波束 θ_PB ≈ 1.13λ/D ≈ 16.9″。","observationEn":"Order-of-magnitude cue: Angular resolution θ ≈ λ/B_max: at 345 GHz (λ = 0.87 mm) and B_max = 16 km, θ ≈ 0.87×10⁻³/16000 = 5.4×10⁻⁸ rad ≈ 0.011″ (11 milliarcseconds); the 12 m primary beam is θ_PB ≈ 1.13λ/D ≈ 16.9″.","failure":"常見誤解：「基線越長影像品質一定越好，短基線只是備用。」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在方塊圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。","failureEn":"Common misconception: \"Longer baselines always give better images; short baselines are just backup.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your block diagram where it breaks down.","check":"方塊圖標明「基線向量與 uv 平面」的輸入、輸出與邊界；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。","checkEn":"The block diagram shows inputs, outputs and boundaries of “Baseline vectors and the uv plane”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.","knowledge":[{"id":"a494-v12-05-k1","title":"干涉成像、角解析度與可回復尺度","titleEn":"Interferometric imaging, angular resolution and recoverable scales","text":"干涉儀把每一對天線的相關輸出視為天空亮度分佈的一個空間頻率分量（可見度），空間頻率由基線向量在垂直於視線方向的投影除以波長決定。ALMA 的角解析度由最長基線 B_max 決定，約為 λ/B_max；最大可回復的擴散結構則由最短基線 B_min 決定。","textEn":"An interferometer treats the correlated output of each antenna pair as one spatial-frequency component of the sky brightness (a visibility), with spatial frequency set by the baseline vector projected perpendicular to the line of sight divided by wavelength. ALMA's angular resolution is set by the longest baseline B_max, roughly λ/B_max, while the largest recoverable extended structure is set by the shortest baseline B_min.","sourceIds":["v12o-alma-about","v12o-alma-antennas","v12o-eso-alma","v12o-nrao-alma"]},{"id":"a494-v12-05-k2","title":"誤解辨析","titleEn":"Misconception check","text":"誤解：基線越長影像品質一定越好，短基線只是備用。 正確的工程判斷必須回到機制與量級。","textEn":"Misconception: Longer baselines always give better images; short baselines are just backup. Sound engineering judgement goes back to mechanism and magnitude.","sourceIds":["v12o-alma-about","v12o-alma-antennas","v12o-eso-alma","v12o-nrao-alma"]}],"quiz":{"question":"關於「干涉成像、角解析度與可回復尺度」，下列哪一項敘述正確？","questionEn":"Which statement about \"Interferometric imaging, angular resolution and recoverable scales\" is correct?","options":["基線越長影像品質一定越好，短基線只是備用。","25 µm 的面形精度對 ALMA 所有波段都綽綽有餘。","干涉儀把每一對天線的相關輸出視為天空亮度分佈的一個空間頻率分量（可見度），空間頻率由基線向量在垂直於視線方向的投影除以波長決定。"],"optionsEn":["Longer baselines always give better images; short baselines are just backup.","A 25 µm surface is more than good enough for every ALMA band.","An interferometer treats the correlated output of each antenna pair as one spatial-frequency component of the sky brightness (a visibility), with spatial frequency set by the baseline vector projected perpendicular to the line of sight divided by wavelength."],"answer":2,"explanation":"干涉儀把每一對天線的相關輸出視為天空亮度分佈的一個空間頻率分量（可見度），空間頻率由基線向量在垂直於視線方向的投影除以波長決定。 其餘選項是常見誤解。","explanationEn":"An interferometer treats the correlated output of each antenna pair as one spatial-frequency component of the sky brightness (a visibility), with spatial frequency set by the baseline vector projected perpendicular to the line of sight divided by wavelength. The other options are common misconceptions."},"unit":2,"unitFacet":"mechanism","order":5,"sequence":5},{"id":"a494-v12-06","title":"干涉成像、角解析度與可回復尺度：定量估算","titleEn":"Interferometric imaging, angular resolution and recoverable scales: quantitative estimate","estimatedMinutes":30,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-alma-about","v12o-alma-antennas","v12o-eso-alma","v12o-nrao-alma"],"prerequisiteIds":["a494-v12-05"],"objective":"以數值模型估算「基線向量與 uv 平面」的關鍵量，並判斷參數改變時結果的方向與幅度。","objectiveEn":"Estimate the key quantities of “Baseline vectors and the uv plane” with a numerical model and judge the direction and size of changes when a parameter moves.","instruction":"依下列模型逐步重算：角解析度 θ ≈ λ/B_max：在 345 GHz（λ = 0.87 mm）、B_max = 16 km 時 θ ≈ 0.87×10⁻³/16000 = 5.4×10⁻⁸ rad ≈ 0.011″（11 毫角秒）；12 m 天線的主波束 θ_PB ≈ 1.13λ/D ≈ 16.9″。最大可回復尺度約 0.6λ/B_min：12 m 陣列 B_min ≈ 15 m 時約 7″，7 m 陣列 B_min ≈ 9 m 時約 12″。 師傅任務：保留單位重算一次，再只改變一個輸入（例如增加 10%），預測並計算輸出的變化，說明它是線性、平方或更高次方的關係。","instructionEn":"Recalculate step by step: Angular resolution θ ≈ λ/B_max: at 345 GHz (λ = 0.87 mm) and B_max = 16 km, θ ≈ 0.87×10⁻³/16000 = 5.4×10⁻⁸ rad ≈ 0.011″ (11 milliarcseconds); the 12 m primary beam is θ_PB ≈ 1.13λ/D ≈ 16.9″. The largest recoverable scale is about 0.6λ/B_min: roughly 7″ for the 12 m array with B_min ≈ 15 m and 12″ for the 7 m array with B_min ≈ 9 m. Mentor task: redo the calculation keeping units, then change one input (for example by +10%), predict and compute the output change, and state whether the dependence is linear, quadratic or steeper.","observation":"如何核對：觀測一個已知緻密的校正源（類星體）並成像，量測合成波束的半高全寬並與 λ/B_max 的預測比較；再觀測一個已知尺度的擴散源（行星或分子雲），比較僅用 12 m 陣列與加入 7 m 陣列後回復的總流量，確認短基線缺失造成的流量損失。","observationEn":"How to cross-check: Image a known compact calibrator (a quasar), measure the synthesised beam FWHM and compare with the λ/B_max prediction; then observe a source of known extent (a planet or a molecular cloud), compare the total flux recovered with the 12 m array alone against 12 m plus 7 m data, and confirm the flux lost to missing short spacings.","failure":"計算陷阱：單位換算錯誤、把教學假設當成設備規格，或只看結果不檢查數量級，都會讓後續設計判斷失準。","failureEn":"Calculation traps: unit conversion slips, treating teaching assumptions as equipment specifications, or accepting a result without checking its magnitude will mislead later design decisions.","check":"重現模型中的數值（取整誤差在 ±5% 內），並提交一個參數改變後的敏感度計算與物理解釋。","checkEn":"Reproduce the model values (within ±5% rounding) and submit a sensitivity calculation for one changed parameter with a physical explanation.","knowledge":[{"id":"a494-v12-06-k1","title":"定量模型","titleEn":"Quantitative model","text":"角解析度 θ ≈ λ/B_max：在 345 GHz（λ = 0.87 mm）、B_max = 16 km 時 θ ≈ 0.87×10⁻³/16000 = 5.4×10⁻⁸ rad ≈ 0.011″（11 毫角秒）；12 m 天線的主波束 θ_PB ≈ 1.13λ/D ≈ 16.9″。最大可回復尺度約 0.6λ/B_min：12 m 陣列 B_min ≈ 15 m 時約 7″，7 m 陣列 B_min ≈ 9 m 時約 12″。","textEn":"Angular resolution θ ≈ λ/B_max: at 345 GHz (λ = 0.87 mm) and B_max = 16 km, θ ≈ 0.87×10⁻³/16000 = 5.4×10⁻⁸ rad ≈ 0.011″ (11 milliarcseconds); the 12 m primary beam is θ_PB ≈ 1.13λ/D ≈ 16.9″. The largest recoverable scale is about 0.6λ/B_min: roughly 7″ for the 12 m array with B_min ≈ 15 m and 12″ for the 7 m array with B_min ≈ 9 m.","sourceIds":["v12o-alma-about","v12o-alma-antennas","v12o-eso-alma","v12o-nrao-alma"]},{"id":"a494-v12-06-k2","title":"模型邊界","titleEn":"Model boundary","text":"本步數值為教學假設；套用到實際設備前，必須重新取得規格、操作條件與不確定度。","textEn":"These numbers are teaching assumptions; before applying them to real equipment, obtain the actual specifications, operating conditions and uncertainties.","sourceIds":["v12o-alma-about","v12o-alma-antennas","v12o-eso-alma","v12o-nrao-alma"]}],"quiz":{"question":"依「干涉成像、角解析度與可回復尺度」的定量模型，下列哪一項敘述成立？","questionEn":"According to the quantitative model for \"Interferometric imaging, angular resolution and recoverable scales\", which statement holds?","options":["角解析度 θ ≈ λ/B_max：在 345 GHz（λ = 0.87 mm）、B_max = 16 km 時 θ ≈ 0.87×10⁻³/16000 = 5.4×10⁻⁸ rad ≈ 0.011″（11 毫角秒）。","乾燥站址上的大氣相位是穩定的，只要校正一次即可。","天線數加倍，靈敏度就恰好加倍。"],"optionsEn":["Angular resolution θ ≈ λ/B_max: at 345 GHz (λ = 0.87 mm) and B_max = 16 km, θ ≈ 0.87×10⁻³/16000 = 5.4×10⁻⁸ rad ≈ 0.011″ (11 milliarcseconds).","At a dry site the atmospheric phase is stable, so one calibration is enough.","Doubling the number of antennas exactly doubles the sensitivity."],"answer":0,"explanation":"角解析度 θ ≈ λ/B_max：在 345 GHz（λ = 0.87 mm）、B_max = 16 km 時 θ ≈ 0.87×10⁻³/16000 = 5.4×10⁻⁸ rad ≈ 0.011″（11 毫角秒）；12 m 天線的主波束 θ_PB ≈ 1.13λ/D ≈ 16.9″。 重算時請保留單位。","explanationEn":"Angular resolution θ ≈ λ/B_max: at 345 GHz (λ = 0.87 mm) and B_max = 16 km, θ ≈ 0.87×10⁻³/16000 = 5.4×10⁻⁸ rad ≈ 0.011″ (11 milliarcseconds); the 12 m primary beam is θ_PB ≈ 1.13λ/D ≈ 16.9″. Keep units when recalculating."},"unit":2,"unitFacet":"model","order":6,"sequence":6},{"id":"a494-v12-07","title":"干涉成像、角解析度與可回復尺度：量測與驗證","titleEn":"Interferometric imaging, angular resolution and recoverable scales: measurement and verification","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-alma-about","v12o-alma-antennas","v12o-eso-alma","v12o-nrao-alma"],"prerequisiteIds":["a494-v12-06"],"objective":"設計一項可重複的量測，驗證「基線向量與 uv 平面」是否符合模型預期，並訂出允收準則。","objectiveEn":"Design a repeatable measurement that verifies whether “Baseline vectors and the uv plane” meets the model expectation, and set acceptance criteria.","instruction":"觀測一個已知緻密的校正源（類星體）並成像，量測合成波束的半高全寬並與 λ/B_max 的預測比較；再觀測一個已知尺度的擴散源（行星或分子雲），比較僅用 12 m 陣列與加入 7 m 陣列後回復的總流量，確認短基線缺失造成的流量損失。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成量測計畫，列出儀器、基準件或參考樣品、步驟、比較對象與允收準則，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。","instructionEn":"Image a known compact calibrator (a quasar), measure the synthesised beam FWHM and compare with the λ/B_max prediction; then observe a source of known extent (a planet or a molecular cloud), compare the total flux recovered with the 12 m array alone against 12 m plus 7 m data, and confirm the flux lost to missing short spacings. Mentor task: turn this into a measurement plan listing instruments, reference artefacts or samples, procedure, comparison baseline and acceptance criteria, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.","observation":"注意干擾：只用長基線配置觀測擴散分子雲時，大於可回復尺度的結構在影像中被濾掉，出現負碗狀底座與低估的總流量；研究者若把這當成真實的空洞結構，科學結論就錯了。","observationEn":"Watch for interference: Observing an extended molecular cloud only in a long-baseline configuration filters out structure larger than the recoverable scale, producing a negative bowl and an underestimated total flux; a researcher who reads that as a real cavity draws the wrong scientific conclusion.","failure":"驗證陷阱：只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄環境條件，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。","failureEn":"Verification traps: a single measurement, no traceable reference, or unrecorded environmental conditions make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.","check":"提交量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格。","checkEn":"Submit the measurement plan: instruments, reference, procedure, acceptance criteria and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail decision rule.","knowledge":[{"id":"a494-v12-07-k1","title":"驗證方法","titleEn":"Verification method","text":"觀測一個已知緻密的校正源（類星體）並成像，量測合成波束的半高全寬並與 λ/B_max 的預測比較；再觀測一個已知尺度的擴散源（行星或分子雲），比較僅用 12 m 陣列與加入 7 m 陣列後回復的總流量，確認短基線缺失造成的流量損失。","textEn":"Image a known compact calibrator (a quasar), measure the synthesised beam FWHM and compare with the λ/B_max prediction; then observe a source of known extent (a planet or a molecular cloud), compare the total flux recovered with the 12 m array alone against 12 m plus 7 m data, and confirm the flux lost to missing short spacings.","sourceIds":["v12o-alma-about","v12o-alma-antennas","v12o-eso-alma","v12o-nrao-alma"]},{"id":"a494-v12-07-k2","title":"允收與不確定度","titleEn":"Acceptance and uncertainty","text":"允收準則必須在量測前訂定，並與擴充不確定度一起陳述；比較基準需可追溯。","textEn":"Acceptance criteria are fixed before measuring and stated together with expanded uncertainty; the comparison reference must be traceable.","sourceIds":["v12o-alma-about","v12o-alma-antennas","v12o-eso-alma","v12o-nrao-alma"]}],"quiz":{"question":"要驗證「干涉成像、角解析度與可回復尺度」，下列哪一個做法最恰當？","questionEn":"Which approach best verifies \"Interferometric imaging, angular resolution and recoverable scales\"?","options":["沿用另一台設備或另一個案例的量測結果，就可視為本系統已完成驗證。","觀測一個已知緻密的校正源（類星體）並成像，量測合成波束的半高全寬並與 λ/B_max 的預測比較。","每座天線各自通過驗收，陣列就自動可以做科學觀測。"],"optionsEn":["Reusing results from another instrument or another case counts as verifying this system.","Image a known compact calibrator (a quasar), measure the synthesised beam FWHM and compare with the λ/B_max prediction.","If every antenna passes its own acceptance, the array is automatically ready for science."],"answer":1,"explanation":"觀測一個已知緻密的校正源（類星體）並成像，量測合成波束的半高全寬並與 λ/B_max 的預測比較；再觀測一個已知尺度的擴散源（行星或分子雲），比較僅用 12 m 陣列與加入 7 m 陣列後回復的總流量，確認短基線缺失造成的流量損失。 驗證需要基準、重複性與允收準則。","explanationEn":"Image a known compact calibrator (a quasar), measure the synthesised beam FWHM and compare with the λ/B_max prediction; then observe a source of known extent (a planet or a molecular cloud), compare the total flux recovered with the 12 m array alone against 12 m plus 7 m data, and confirm the flux lost to missing short spacings. Verification needs a reference, repeatability and acceptance criteria."},"unit":2,"unitFacet":"verification","order":7,"sequence":7},{"id":"a494-v12-08","title":"干涉成像、角解析度與可回復尺度：失效診斷","titleEn":"Interferometric imaging, angular resolution and recoverable scales: failure diagnosis","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-alma-about","v12o-alma-antennas","v12o-eso-alma","v12o-nrao-alma"],"prerequisiteIds":["a494-v12-07"],"objective":"從症狀倒推「基線向量與 uv 平面」的失效原因，提出能區分原因的檢查與矯正措施。","objectiveEn":"Work back from symptoms to the failure causes of “Baseline vectors and the uv plane” and propose discriminating checks and corrective actions.","instruction":"只用長基線配置觀測擴散分子雲時，大於可回復尺度的結構在影像中被濾掉，出現負碗狀底座與低估的總流量；研究者若把這當成真實的空洞結構，科學結論就錯了。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整個系統的性能、良率或安全。","instructionEn":"Observing an extended molecular cloud only in a long-baseline configuration filters out structure larger than the recoverable scale, producing a negative bowl and an underestimated total flux; a researcher who reads that as a real cavity draws the wrong scientific conclusion. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-system performance, yield or safety.","observation":"連結機制：50 座 12 m 天線可在 150 m 到 16 km 之間重組，12 座 7 m 天線與 4 座 12 m 全功率天線組成的 Morita 緊湊陣列補足短基線與零基線資訊，使擴散結構的總流量不致流失。","observationEn":"Link to the mechanism: Fifty 12 m antennas can be reconfigured between 150 m and 16 km, and the Morita compact array of twelve 7 m antennas plus four 12 m total-power antennas supplies short and zero spacings so that the flux of extended emission is not lost.","failure":"誤判風險：若相信「基線越長影像品質一定越好，短基線只是備用。」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。","failureEn":"Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"Longer baselines always give better images; short baselines are just backup.\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.","check":"完成失效樹與矯正措施，並指出哪一項量測能最快確認根因、如何防止再發。","checkEn":"Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement that confirms the root cause fastest, and state how recurrence is prevented.","knowledge":[{"id":"a494-v12-08-k1","title":"失效模式","titleEn":"Failure mode","text":"只用長基線配置觀測擴散分子雲時，大於可回復尺度的結構在影像中被濾掉，出現負碗狀底座與低估的總流量；研究者若把這當成真實的空洞結構，科學結論就錯了。","textEn":"Observing an extended molecular cloud only in a long-baseline configuration filters out structure larger than the recoverable scale, producing a negative bowl and an underestimated total flux; a researcher who reads that as a real cavity draws the wrong scientific conclusion.","sourceIds":["v12o-alma-about","v12o-alma-antennas","v12o-eso-alma","v12o-nrao-alma"]},{"id":"a494-v12-08-k2","title":"根因確認","titleEn":"Root-cause confirmation","text":"根因必須以可區分的量測確認；只更換零件或放寬參數可能掩蓋問題。","textEn":"Confirm the root cause with a discriminating measurement; merely swapping parts or relaxing limits can mask the problem.","sourceIds":["v12o-alma-about","v12o-alma-antennas","v12o-eso-alma","v12o-nrao-alma"]}],"quiz":{"question":"在「干涉成像、角解析度與可回復尺度」出現異常時，下列哪一項判斷最合理？","questionEn":"When \"Interferometric imaging, angular resolution and recoverable scales\" misbehaves, which diagnosis is most reasonable?","options":["調高增益或放寬允收值，就能解決大多數異常。","25 µm 的面形精度對 ALMA 所有波段都綽綽有餘。","只用長基線配置觀測擴散分子雲時，大於可回復尺度的結構在影像中被濾掉，出現負碗狀底座與低估的總流量；研究者若把這當成真實的空洞結構，科學結論就錯了。"],"optionsEn":["Raising the gain or widening the acceptance limits solves most anomalies.","A 25 µm surface is more than good enough for every ALMA band.","Observing an extended molecular cloud only in a long-baseline configuration filters out structure larger than the recoverable scale, producing a negative bowl and an underestimated total flux."],"answer":2,"explanation":"只用長基線配置觀測擴散分子雲時，大於可回復尺度的結構在影像中被濾掉，出現負碗狀底座與低估的總流量；研究者若把這當成真實的空洞結構，科學結論就錯了。 需以量測區分可能原因。","explanationEn":"Observing an extended molecular cloud only in a long-baseline configuration filters out structure larger than the recoverable scale, producing a negative bowl and an underestimated total flux; a researcher who reads that as a real cavity draws the wrong scientific conclusion. Discriminate candidate causes by measurement."},"unit":2,"unitFacet":"failure","order":8,"sequence":8}],"order":1},{"id":"a494-v12-s2","title":"元件、材料與製造","titleEn":"Components, materials and fabrication","description":"本階段聚焦「天線面形精度、Ruze 效率與指向」與「前端接收機：SIS 混頻器與系統溫度」：先建立機制與定量模型，再設計驗證並診斷失效。","descriptionEn":"This stage covers \"Antenna surface accuracy, Ruze efficiency and pointing\" and \"Front-end receivers: SIS mixers and system temperature\": build the mechanism and quantitative model first, then design verification and diagnose failures.","steps":[{"id":"a494-v12-09","title":"天線面形精度、Ruze 效率與指向：原理與系統邊界","titleEn":"Antenna surface accuracy, Ruze efficiency and pointing: mechanism and system boundary","estimatedMinutes":20,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-alma-about","v12o-alma-antennas","v12o-eso-alma","v12o-nrao-alma"],"prerequisiteIds":["a494-v12-08"],"objective":"說明「12 m 天線碳纖維背架與面板」如何決定ALMA 大型毫米及次毫米波陣列的關鍵性能，並畫出其輸入、輸出與邊界。","objectiveEn":"Explain how “12 m antenna CFRP backup structure and panels” determines the key performance of “Atacama Large Millimeter/submillimeter Array”, and map its inputs, outputs and boundaries.","instruction":"ALMA 的 12 m 天線使用碳纖維複合材料（CFRP）背架與鋁質（部分為鍍鎳）面板，在 5000 m 的日照、風與 −20 °C 到 +20 °C 溫差下仍要維持 25 µm 的面形精度與 0.6″ 的絕對指向，主鏡以卡塞格林光學把訊號饋入接收機艙。面板的隨機誤差把部分功率散射到主波束外，損失依 Ruze 公式隨 (ε/λ)² 指數增長，因此次毫米波段對面形最敏感；指向誤差則讓源偏離主波束中心而損失增益。 師傅任務：以方塊圖畫出能量或訊號通過「12 m 天線碳纖維背架與面板」的路徑，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由環境或製造決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。","instructionEn":"ALMA's 12 m antennas use carbon-fibre-reinforced-plastic (CFRP) backup structures with aluminium (partly nickel-plated) panels, and must hold a 25 µm surface accuracy and 0.6″ absolute pointing under the sun, wind and −20 °C to +20 °C swings of the 5000 m site; Cassegrain optics feed the receiver cabin. Random panel errors scatter power out of the main beam with a loss that grows exponentially with (ε/λ)² according to the Ruze formula, so the submillimetre bands are the most sensitive to surface figure, while pointing errors move the source off the beam centre and lose gain. Mentor task: draw a block diagram of the energy or signal path through “12 m antenna CFRP backup structure and panels”, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by environment or fabrication, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.","observation":"量級提示：Ruze 效率 η_s = exp[−(4πε/λ)²]。","observationEn":"Order-of-magnitude cue: Ruze efficiency η_s = exp[−(4πε/λ)²].","failure":"常見誤解：「25 µm 的面形精度對 ALMA 所有波段都綽綽有餘。」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在方塊圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。","failureEn":"Common misconception: \"A 25 µm surface is more than good enough for every ALMA band.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your block diagram where it breaks down.","check":"方塊圖標明「12 m 天線碳纖維背架與面板」的輸入、輸出與邊界；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。","checkEn":"The block diagram shows inputs, outputs and boundaries of “12 m antenna CFRP backup structure and panels”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.","knowledge":[{"id":"a494-v12-09-k1","title":"天線面形精度、Ruze 效率與指向","titleEn":"Antenna surface accuracy, Ruze efficiency and pointing","text":"ALMA 的 12 m 天線使用碳纖維複合材料（CFRP）背架與鋁質（部分為鍍鎳）面板，在 5000 m 的日照、風與 −20 °C 到 +20 °C 溫差下仍要維持 25 µm 的面形精度與 0.6″ 的絕對指向，主鏡以卡塞格林光學把訊號饋入接收機艙。面板的隨機誤差把部分功率散射到主波束外，損失依 Ruze 公式隨 (ε/λ)² 指數增長，因此次毫米波段對面形最敏感；指向誤差則讓源偏離主波束中心而損失增益。","textEn":"ALMA's 12 m antennas use carbon-fibre-reinforced-plastic (CFRP) backup structures with aluminium (partly nickel-plated) panels, and must hold a 25 µm surface accuracy and 0.6″ absolute pointing under the sun, wind and −20 °C to +20 °C swings of the 5000 m site; Cassegrain optics feed the receiver cabin. Random panel errors scatter power out of the main beam with a loss that grows exponentially with (ε/λ)² according to the Ruze formula, so the submillimetre bands are the most sensitive to surface figure, while pointing errors move the source off the beam centre and lose gain.","sourceIds":["v12o-alma-about","v12o-alma-antennas","v12o-eso-alma","v12o-nrao-alma"]},{"id":"a494-v12-09-k2","title":"誤解辨析","titleEn":"Misconception check","text":"誤解：25 µm 的面形精度對 ALMA 所有波段都綽綽有餘。 正確的工程判斷必須回到機制與量級。","textEn":"Misconception: A 25 µm surface is more than good enough for every ALMA band. Sound engineering judgement goes back to mechanism and magnitude.","sourceIds":["v12o-alma-about","v12o-alma-antennas","v12o-eso-alma","v12o-nrao-alma"]}],"quiz":{"question":"關於「天線面形精度、Ruze 效率與指向」，下列哪一項敘述正確？","questionEn":"Which statement about \"Antenna surface accuracy, Ruze efficiency and pointing\" is correct?","options":["ALMA 的 12 m 天線使用碳纖維複合材料（CFRP）背架與鋁質（部分為鍍鎳）面板，在 5000 m 的日照、風與 −20 °C 到 +20 °C 溫差下仍要維持 25 µm 的面形精度與 0.6″ 的絕對指向，主鏡以卡塞格林光學把訊號饋入接收機艙。","25 µm 的面形精度對 ALMA 所有波段都綽綽有餘。","接收機冷到 4 K 之後，系統溫度就只剩天空的貢獻。"],"optionsEn":["ALMA's 12 m antennas use carbon-fibre-reinforced-plastic (CFRP) backup structures with aluminium (partly nickel-plated) panels, and must hold a 25 µm surface accuracy and 0.6″ absolute pointing under the sun, wind and −20 °C to +20 °C swings of the 5000 m site.","A 25 µm surface is more than good enough for every ALMA band.","Once the receiver is at 4 K, the system temperature is only the sky's contribution."],"answer":0,"explanation":"ALMA 的 12 m 天線使用碳纖維複合材料（CFRP）背架與鋁質（部分為鍍鎳）面板，在 5000 m 的日照、風與 −20 °C 到 +20 °C 溫差下仍要維持 25 µm 的面形精度與 0.6″ 的絕對指向，主鏡以卡塞格林光學把訊號饋入接收機艙。 其餘選項是常見誤解。","explanationEn":"ALMA's 12 m antennas use carbon-fibre-reinforced-plastic (CFRP) backup structures with aluminium (partly nickel-plated) panels, and must hold a 25 µm surface accuracy and 0.6″ absolute pointing under the sun, wind and −20 °C to +20 °C swings of the 5000 m site; Cassegrain optics feed the receiver cabin. The other options are common misconceptions."},"unit":3,"unitFacet":"mechanism","order":1,"sequence":9},{"id":"a494-v12-10","title":"天線面形精度、Ruze 效率與指向：定量估算","titleEn":"Antenna surface accuracy, Ruze efficiency and pointing: quantitative estimate","estimatedMinutes":30,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-alma-about","v12o-alma-antennas","v12o-eso-alma","v12o-nrao-alma"],"prerequisiteIds":["a494-v12-09"],"objective":"以數值模型估算「12 m 天線碳纖維背架與面板」的關鍵量，並判斷參數改變時結果的方向與幅度。","objectiveEn":"Estimate the key quantities of “12 m antenna CFRP backup structure and panels” with a numerical model and judge the direction and size of changes when a parameter moves.","instruction":"依下列模型逐步重算：Ruze 效率 η_s = exp[−(4πε/λ)²]。取 ε = 25 µm（RMS）：λ = 3 mm 時 (4π×0.025/3)² = 0.011，η_s = 0.989；λ = 0.87 mm 時 (0.361)² = 0.130，η_s = 0.878；λ = 0.32 mm（Band 10）時 (0.982)² = 0.964，η_s = 0.381。可見同一面形在 Band 10 已損失六成功率。 師傅任務：保留單位重算一次，再只改變一個輸入（例如增加 10%），預測並計算輸出的變化，說明它是線性、平方或更高次方的關係。","instructionEn":"Recalculate step by step: Ruze efficiency η_s = exp[−(4πε/λ)²]. With ε = 25 µm RMS: at λ = 3 mm, (4π×0.025/3)² = 0.011 and η_s = 0.989; at λ = 0.87 mm, (0.361)² = 0.130 and η_s = 0.878; at λ = 0.32 mm (Band 10), (0.982)² = 0.964 and η_s = 0.381, so the same surface already loses sixty percent of the power in Band 10. Mentor task: redo the calculation keeping units, then change one input (for example by +10%), predict and compute the output change, and state whether the dependence is linear, quadratic or steeper.","observation":"如何核對：在 OSF（海拔 2900 m）以近場全像（holography）對準塔上發射器量測面板相位，解出每片面板的高度與傾斜誤差並調整；在高原上以行星做徑向全像或以多頻段口徑效率量測反推 ε，並以指向校正觀測（全天 pointing run）擬合指向模型殘差，確認 RMS 在 2″（相對指向）與 0.6″（絕對）以內。","observationEn":"How to cross-check: At the OSF (2900 m) measure panel phase with near-field holography against a tower transmitter, solve each panel's height and tilt errors and adjust; on the plateau back out ε from multi-band aperture-efficiency measurements or planet holography, and fit a pointing model from an all-sky pointing run, confirming residuals within 2″ (offset pointing) and 0.6″ (absolute).","failure":"計算陷阱：單位換算錯誤、把教學假設當成設備規格，或只看結果不檢查數量級，都會讓後續設計判斷失準。","failureEn":"Calculation traps: unit conversion slips, treating teaching assumptions as equipment specifications, or accepting a result without checking its magnitude will mislead later design decisions.","check":"重現模型中的數值（取整誤差在 ±5% 內），並提交一個參數改變後的敏感度計算與物理解釋。","checkEn":"Reproduce the model values (within ±5% rounding) and submit a sensitivity calculation for one changed parameter with a physical explanation.","knowledge":[{"id":"a494-v12-10-k1","title":"定量模型","titleEn":"Quantitative model","text":"Ruze 效率 η_s = exp[−(4πε/λ)²]。取 ε = 25 µm（RMS）：λ = 3 mm 時 (4π×0.025/3)² = 0.011，η_s = 0.989；λ = 0.87 mm 時 (0.361)² = 0.130，η_s = 0.878；λ = 0.32 mm（Band 10）時 (0.982)² = 0.964，η_s = 0.381。可見同一面形在 Band 10 已損失六成功率。","textEn":"Ruze efficiency η_s = exp[−(4πε/λ)²]. With ε = 25 µm RMS: at λ = 3 mm, (4π×0.025/3)² = 0.011 and η_s = 0.989; at λ = 0.87 mm, (0.361)² = 0.130 and η_s = 0.878; at λ = 0.32 mm (Band 10), (0.982)² = 0.964 and η_s = 0.381, so the same surface already loses sixty percent of the power in Band 10.","sourceIds":["v12o-alma-about","v12o-alma-antennas","v12o-eso-alma","v12o-nrao-alma"]},{"id":"a494-v12-10-k2","title":"模型邊界","titleEn":"Model boundary","text":"本步數值為教學假設；套用到實際設備前，必須重新取得規格、操作條件與不確定度。","textEn":"These numbers are teaching assumptions; before applying them to real equipment, obtain the actual specifications, operating conditions and uncertainties.","sourceIds":["v12o-alma-about","v12o-alma-antennas","v12o-eso-alma","v12o-nrao-alma"]}],"quiz":{"question":"依「天線面形精度、Ruze 效率與指向」的定量模型，下列哪一項敘述成立？","questionEn":"According to the quantitative model for \"Antenna surface accuracy, Ruze efficiency and pointing\", which statement holds?","options":["流量校正用的行星是理想點源，不需要模型。","Ruze 效率 η_s = exp[−(4πε/λ)²]。","每座天線各自通過驗收，陣列就自動可以做科學觀測。"],"optionsEn":["Planets used for flux calibration are ideal point sources and need no model.","Ruze efficiency η_s = exp[−(4πε/λ)²].","If every antenna passes its own acceptance, the array is automatically ready for science."],"answer":1,"explanation":"Ruze 效率 η_s = exp[−(4πε/λ)²]。 重算時請保留單位。","explanationEn":"Ruze efficiency η_s = exp[−(4πε/λ)²]. Keep units when recalculating."},"unit":3,"unitFacet":"model","order":2,"sequence":10},{"id":"a494-v12-11","title":"天線面形精度、Ruze 效率與指向：量測與驗證","titleEn":"Antenna surface accuracy, Ruze efficiency and pointing: measurement and verification","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-alma-about","v12o-alma-antennas","v12o-eso-alma","v12o-nrao-alma"],"prerequisiteIds":["a494-v12-10"],"objective":"設計一項可重複的量測，驗證「12 m 天線碳纖維背架與面板」是否符合模型預期，並訂出允收準則。","objectiveEn":"Design a repeatable measurement that verifies whether “12 m antenna CFRP backup structure and panels” meets the model expectation, and set acceptance criteria.","instruction":"在 OSF（海拔 2900 m）以近場全像（holography）對準塔上發射器量測面板相位，解出每片面板的高度與傾斜誤差並調整；在高原上以行星做徑向全像或以多頻段口徑效率量測反推 ε，並以指向校正觀測（全天 pointing run）擬合指向模型殘差，確認 RMS 在 2″（相對指向）與 0.6″（絕對）以內。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成量測計畫，列出儀器、基準件或參考樣品、步驟、比較對象與允收準則，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。","instructionEn":"At the OSF (2900 m) measure panel phase with near-field holography against a tower transmitter, solve each panel's height and tilt errors and adjust; on the plateau back out ε from multi-band aperture-efficiency measurements or planet holography, and fit a pointing model from an all-sky pointing run, confirming residuals within 2″ (offset pointing) and 0.6″ (absolute). Mentor task: turn this into a measurement plan listing instruments, reference artefacts or samples, procedure, comparison baseline and acceptance criteria, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.","observation":"注意干擾：日照造成背架單側升溫、面板在白天失去設定面形時，若仍以夜間的全像結果觀測次毫米波段，口徑效率會在午後掉到預期的一半以下，而且各天線損失不同，流量校正也跟著失準。","observationEn":"Watch for interference: When sunlight heats one side of the backup structure and the panels lose their night-time figure, observing the submillimetre bands with the night-time holography solution drops the aperture efficiency to below half the expected value in the afternoon, and because each antenna loses differently, the flux calibration also drifts.","failure":"驗證陷阱：只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄環境條件，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。","failureEn":"Verification traps: a single measurement, no traceable reference, or unrecorded environmental conditions make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.","check":"提交量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格。","checkEn":"Submit the measurement plan: instruments, reference, procedure, acceptance criteria and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail decision rule.","knowledge":[{"id":"a494-v12-11-k1","title":"驗證方法","titleEn":"Verification method","text":"在 OSF（海拔 2900 m）以近場全像（holography）對準塔上發射器量測面板相位，解出每片面板的高度與傾斜誤差並調整；在高原上以行星做徑向全像或以多頻段口徑效率量測反推 ε，並以指向校正觀測（全天 pointing run）擬合指向模型殘差，確認 RMS 在 2″（相對指向）與 0.6″（絕對）以內。","textEn":"At the OSF (2900 m) measure panel phase with near-field holography against a tower transmitter, solve each panel's height and tilt errors and adjust; on the plateau back out ε from multi-band aperture-efficiency measurements or planet holography, and fit a pointing model from an all-sky pointing run, confirming residuals within 2″ (offset pointing) and 0.6″ (absolute).","sourceIds":["v12o-alma-about","v12o-alma-antennas","v12o-eso-alma","v12o-nrao-alma"]},{"id":"a494-v12-11-k2","title":"允收與不確定度","titleEn":"Acceptance and uncertainty","text":"允收準則必須在量測前訂定，並與擴充不確定度一起陳述；比較基準需可追溯。","textEn":"Acceptance criteria are fixed before measuring and stated together with expanded uncertainty; the comparison reference must be traceable.","sourceIds":["v12o-alma-about","v12o-alma-antennas","v12o-eso-alma","v12o-nrao-alma"]}],"quiz":{"question":"要驗證「天線面形精度、Ruze 效率與指向」，下列哪一個做法最恰當？","questionEn":"Which approach best verifies \"Antenna surface accuracy, Ruze efficiency and pointing\"?","options":["只看單次讀值或外觀即可判定合格，不需要基準件或重複量測。","只要天線夠大，站址高度對毫米波觀測影響不大。","在 OSF（海拔 2900 m）以近場全像（holography）對準塔上發射器量測面板相位，解出每片面板的高度與傾斜誤差並調整。"],"optionsEn":["A single reading or a visual impression is enough to accept the result; no reference artefact or repeat measurement is needed.","With big enough antennas, site altitude hardly matters at millimetre wavelengths.","At the OSF (2900 m) measure panel phase with near-field holography against a tower transmitter, solve each panel's height and tilt errors and adjust."],"answer":2,"explanation":"在 OSF（海拔 2900 m）以近場全像（holography）對準塔上發射器量測面板相位，解出每片面板的高度與傾斜誤差並調整；在高原上以行星做徑向全像或以多頻段口徑效率量測反推 ε，並以指向校正觀測（全天 pointing run）擬合指向模型殘差，確認 RMS 在 2″（相對指向）與 0.6″（絕對）以內。 驗證需要基準、重複性與允收準則。","explanationEn":"At the OSF (2900 m) measure panel phase with near-field holography against a tower transmitter, solve each panel's height and tilt errors and adjust; on the plateau back out ε from multi-band aperture-efficiency measurements or planet holography, and fit a pointing model from an all-sky pointing run, confirming residuals within 2″ (offset pointing) and 0.6″ (absolute). Verification needs a reference, repeatability and acceptance criteria."},"unit":3,"unitFacet":"verification","order":3,"sequence":11},{"id":"a494-v12-12","title":"天線面形精度、Ruze 效率與指向：失效診斷","titleEn":"Antenna surface accuracy, Ruze efficiency and pointing: failure diagnosis","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-alma-about","v12o-alma-antennas","v12o-eso-alma","v12o-nrao-alma"],"prerequisiteIds":["a494-v12-11"],"objective":"從症狀倒推「12 m 天線碳纖維背架與面板」的失效原因，提出能區分原因的檢查與矯正措施。","objectiveEn":"Work back from symptoms to the failure causes of “12 m antenna CFRP backup structure and panels” and propose discriminating checks and corrective actions.","instruction":"日照造成背架單側升溫、面板在白天失去設定面形時，若仍以夜間的全像結果觀測次毫米波段，口徑效率會在午後掉到預期的一半以下，而且各天線損失不同，流量校正也跟著失準。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整個系統的性能、良率或安全。","instructionEn":"When sunlight heats one side of the backup structure and the panels lose their night-time figure, observing the submillimetre bands with the night-time holography solution drops the aperture efficiency to below half the expected value in the afternoon, and because each antenna loses differently, the flux calibration also drifts. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-system performance, yield or safety.","observation":"連結機制：面板的隨機誤差把部分功率散射到主波束外，損失依 Ruze 公式隨 (ε/λ)² 指數增長，因此次毫米波段對面形最敏感；指向誤差則讓源偏離主波束中心而損失增益。","observationEn":"Link to the mechanism: Random panel errors scatter power out of the main beam with a loss that grows exponentially with (ε/λ)² according to the Ruze formula, so the submillimetre bands are the most sensitive to surface figure, while pointing errors move the source off the beam centre and lose gain.","failure":"誤判風險：若相信「25 µm 的面形精度對 ALMA 所有波段都綽綽有餘。」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。","failureEn":"Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"A 25 µm surface is more than good enough for every ALMA band.\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.","check":"完成失效樹與矯正措施，並指出哪一項量測能最快確認根因、如何防止再發。","checkEn":"Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement that confirms the root cause fastest, and state how recurrence is prevented.","knowledge":[{"id":"a494-v12-12-k1","title":"失效模式","titleEn":"Failure mode","text":"日照造成背架單側升溫、面板在白天失去設定面形時，若仍以夜間的全像結果觀測次毫米波段，口徑效率會在午後掉到預期的一半以下，而且各天線損失不同，流量校正也跟著失準。","textEn":"When sunlight heats one side of the backup structure and the panels lose their night-time figure, observing the submillimetre bands with the night-time holography solution drops the aperture efficiency to below half the expected value in the afternoon, and because each antenna loses differently, the flux calibration also drifts.","sourceIds":["v12o-alma-about","v12o-alma-antennas","v12o-eso-alma","v12o-nrao-alma"]},{"id":"a494-v12-12-k2","title":"根因確認","titleEn":"Root-cause confirmation","text":"根因必須以可區分的量測確認；只更換零件或放寬參數可能掩蓋問題。","textEn":"Confirm the root cause with a discriminating measurement; merely swapping parts or relaxing limits can mask the problem.","sourceIds":["v12o-alma-about","v12o-alma-antennas","v12o-eso-alma","v12o-nrao-alma"]}],"quiz":{"question":"在「天線面形精度、Ruze 效率與指向」出現異常時，下列哪一項判斷最合理？","questionEn":"When \"Antenna surface accuracy, Ruze efficiency and pointing\" misbehaves, which diagnosis is most reasonable?","options":["日照造成背架單側升溫、面板在白天失去設定面形時，若仍以夜間的全像結果觀測次毫米波段，口徑效率會在午後掉到預期的一半以下，而且各天線損失不同，流量校正也跟著失準。","異常只出現一次就可以忽略，不需要記錄或追蹤。","接收機冷到 4 K 之後，系統溫度就只剩天空的貢獻。"],"optionsEn":["When sunlight heats one side of the backup structure and the panels lose their night-time figure, observing the submillimetre bands with the night-time holography solution drops the aperture efficiency to below half the expected value in the afternoon, and because each antenna loses differently, the flux calibration also drifts.","An anomaly that appears only once can be ignored without logging or follow-up.","Once the receiver is at 4 K, the system temperature is only the sky's contribution."],"answer":0,"explanation":"日照造成背架單側升溫、面板在白天失去設定面形時，若仍以夜間的全像結果觀測次毫米波段，口徑效率會在午後掉到預期的一半以下，而且各天線損失不同，流量校正也跟著失準。 需以量測區分可能原因。","explanationEn":"When sunlight heats one side of the backup structure and the panels lose their night-time figure, observing the submillimetre bands with the night-time holography solution drops the aperture efficiency to below half the expected value in the afternoon, and because each antenna loses differently, the flux calibration also drifts. Discriminate candidate causes by measurement."},"unit":3,"unitFacet":"failure","order":4,"sequence":12},{"id":"a494-v12-13","title":"前端接收機：SIS 混頻器與系統溫度：原理與系統邊界","titleEn":"Front-end receivers: SIS mixers and system temperature: mechanism and system boundary","estimatedMinutes":20,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-alma-about","v12o-alma-antennas","v12o-eso-alma","v12o-nrao-alma"],"prerequisiteIds":["a494-v12-12"],"objective":"說明「4 K 低溫恆溫器與 SIS 混頻器」如何決定ALMA 大型毫米及次毫米波陣列的關鍵性能，並畫出其輸入、輸出與邊界。","objectiveEn":"Explain how “4 K cryostat and SIS mixers” determines the key performance of “Atacama Large Millimeter/submillimeter Array”, and map its inputs, outputs and boundaries.","instruction":"每座天線的前端在同一個三級低溫恆溫器內裝十個波段的接收卡匣，Band 3 到 10 使用超導-絕緣體-超導（SIS）穿隧接面混頻器，在約 4 K 工作，把天空訊號與本地振盪器（LO）訊號混頻降到中頻；低頻的 Band 1 與 2 則使用 HEMT 低雜訊放大器。SIS 混頻器的雜訊可接近量子極限 hν/k 的數倍，因此接收機雜訊、天空雜訊與光學損耗合起來的系統溫度 T_sys 才是靈敏度的真正決定因素。LO 參考由中央光子產生器經光纖分送到各天線並鎖相，以保持陣列相位一致。 師傅任務：以方塊圖畫出能量或訊號通過「4 K 低溫恆溫器與 SIS 混頻器」的路徑，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由環境或製造決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。","instructionEn":"Each antenna's front end holds ten band cartridges inside one three-stage cryostat; Bands 3 to 10 use superconductor-insulator-superconductor (SIS) tunnel-junction mixers operating near 4 K that mix the sky signal with a local-oscillator (LO) tone down to an intermediate frequency, while the low-frequency Bands 1 and 2 use HEMT low-noise amplifiers. SIS mixer noise can approach a few times the quantum limit hν/k, so the system temperature T_sys, combining receiver noise, sky noise and optical loss, is what really sets sensitivity. The LO reference is generated photonically at the central building, distributed over fibre to every antenna and phase-locked to keep the array coherent. Mentor task: draw a block diagram of the energy or signal path through “4 K cryostat and SIS mixers”, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by environment or fabrication, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.","observation":"量級提示：量子極限 T_q = hν/k 在 345 GHz 為 6.626×10⁻³⁴×3.45×10¹¹/1.381×10⁻²³ ≈ 16.6 K；取接收機溫度 T_rx = 70 K（約 4 倍量子極限，教學假設）。","observationEn":"Order-of-magnitude cue: The quantum limit T_q = hν/k at 345 GHz is 6.626×10⁻³⁴×3.45×10¹¹/1.381×10⁻²³ ≈ 16.6 K; take a receiver temperature T_rx = 70 K (about four times the quantum limit, a teaching assumption).","failure":"常見誤解：「接收機冷到 4 K 之後，系統溫度就只剩天空的貢獻。」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在方塊圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。","failureEn":"Common misconception: \"Once the receiver is at 4 K, the system temperature is only the sky's contribution.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your block diagram where it breaks down.","check":"方塊圖標明「4 K 低溫恆溫器與 SIS 混頻器」的輸入、輸出與邊界；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。","checkEn":"The block diagram shows inputs, outputs and boundaries of “4 K cryostat and SIS mixers”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.","knowledge":[{"id":"a494-v12-13-k1","title":"前端接收機：SIS 混頻器與系統溫度","titleEn":"Front-end receivers: SIS mixers and system temperature","text":"每座天線的前端在同一個三級低溫恆溫器內裝十個波段的接收卡匣，Band 3 到 10 使用超導-絕緣體-超導（SIS）穿隧接面混頻器，在約 4 K 工作，把天空訊號與本地振盪器（LO）訊號混頻降到中頻；低頻的 Band 1 與 2 則使用 HEMT 低雜訊放大器。SIS 混頻器的雜訊可接近量子極限 hν/k 的數倍，因此接收機雜訊、天空雜訊與光學損耗合起來的系統溫度 T_sys 才是靈敏度的真正決定因素。","textEn":"Each antenna's front end holds ten band cartridges inside one three-stage cryostat; Bands 3 to 10 use superconductor-insulator-superconductor (SIS) tunnel-junction mixers operating near 4 K that mix the sky signal with a local-oscillator (LO) tone down to an intermediate frequency, while the low-frequency Bands 1 and 2 use HEMT low-noise amplifiers. SIS mixer noise can approach a few times the quantum limit hν/k, so the system temperature T_sys, combining receiver noise, sky noise and optical loss, is what really sets sensitivity.","sourceIds":["v12o-alma-about","v12o-alma-antennas","v12o-eso-alma","v12o-nrao-alma"]},{"id":"a494-v12-13-k2","title":"誤解辨析","titleEn":"Misconception check","text":"誤解：接收機冷到 4 K 之後，系統溫度就只剩天空的貢獻。 正確的工程判斷必須回到機制與量級。","textEn":"Misconception: Once the receiver is at 4 K, the system temperature is only the sky's contribution. Sound engineering judgement goes back to mechanism and magnitude.","sourceIds":["v12o-alma-about","v12o-alma-antennas","v12o-eso-alma","v12o-nrao-alma"]}],"quiz":{"question":"關於「前端接收機：SIS 混頻器與系統溫度」，下列哪一項敘述正確？","questionEn":"Which statement about \"Front-end receivers: SIS mixers and system temperature\" is correct?","options":["接收機冷到 4 K 之後，系統溫度就只剩天空的貢獻。","每座天線的前端在同一個三級低溫恆溫器內裝十個波段的接收卡匣，Band 3 到 10 使用超導-絕緣體-超導（SIS）穿隧接面混頻器，在約 4 K 工作，把天空訊號與本地振盪器（LO）訊號混頻降到中頻。","乾燥站址上的大氣相位是穩定的，只要校正一次即可。"],"optionsEn":["Once the receiver is at 4 K, the system temperature is only the sky's contribution.","Each antenna's front end holds ten band cartridges inside one three-stage cryostat.","At a dry site the atmospheric phase is stable, so one calibration is enough."],"answer":1,"explanation":"每座天線的前端在同一個三級低溫恆溫器內裝十個波段的接收卡匣，Band 3 到 10 使用超導-絕緣體-超導（SIS）穿隧接面混頻器，在約 4 K 工作，把天空訊號與本地振盪器（LO）訊號混頻降到中頻；低頻的 Band 1 與 2 則使用 HEMT 低雜訊放大器。 其餘選項是常見誤解。","explanationEn":"Each antenna's front end holds ten band cartridges inside one three-stage cryostat; Bands 3 to 10 use superconductor-insulator-superconductor (SIS) tunnel-junction mixers operating near 4 K that mix the sky signal with a local-oscillator (LO) tone down to an intermediate frequency, while the low-frequency Bands 1 and 2 use HEMT low-noise amplifiers. The other options are common misconceptions."},"unit":4,"unitFacet":"mechanism","order":5,"sequence":13},{"id":"a494-v12-14","title":"前端接收機：SIS 混頻器與系統溫度：定量估算","titleEn":"Front-end receivers: SIS mixers and system temperature: quantitative estimate","estimatedMinutes":30,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-alma-about","v12o-alma-antennas","v12o-eso-alma","v12o-nrao-alma"],"prerequisiteIds":["a494-v12-13"],"objective":"以數值模型估算「4 K 低溫恆溫器與 SIS 混頻器」的關鍵量，並判斷參數改變時結果的方向與幅度。","objectiveEn":"Estimate the key quantities of “4 K cryostat and SIS mixers” with a numerical model and judge the direction and size of changes when a parameter moves.","instruction":"依下列模型逐步重算：量子極限 T_q = hν/k 在 345 GHz 為 6.626×10⁻³⁴×3.45×10¹¹/1.381×10⁻²³ ≈ 16.6 K；取接收機溫度 T_rx = 70 K（約 4 倍量子極限，教學假設）。系統溫度以大氣外為參考：T_sys ≈ (T_rx + T_sky)/exp(−τ₀A)。天頂（T_sky = 36 K、透射率 0.861）時 T_sys ≈ 106/0.861 ≈ 123 K；A = 2（T_sky = 67 K、透射率 0.741）時 T_sys ≈ 137/0.741 ≈ 185 K。 師傅任務：保留單位重算一次，再只改變一個輸入（例如增加 10%），預測並計算輸出的變化，說明它是線性、平方或更高次方的關係。","instructionEn":"Recalculate step by step: The quantum limit T_q = hν/k at 345 GHz is 6.626×10⁻³⁴×3.45×10¹¹/1.381×10⁻²³ ≈ 16.6 K; take a receiver temperature T_rx = 70 K (about four times the quantum limit, a teaching assumption). Referred to above the atmosphere, T_sys ≈ (T_rx + T_sky)/exp(−τ₀A). At zenith (T_sky = 36 K, transmission 0.861) T_sys ≈ 106/0.861 ≈ 123 K; at A = 2 (T_sky = 67 K, transmission 0.741) T_sys ≈ 137/0.741 ≈ 185 K. Mentor task: redo the calculation keeping units, then change one input (for example by +10%), predict and compute the output change, and state whether the dependence is linear, quadratic or steeper.","observation":"如何核對：以熱／冷負載（室溫吸收體與 77 K 液氮負載）做 Y 因子量測：T_rx = (T_hot − Y·T_cold)/(Y − 1)，在每個波段的中頻範圍掃描並與卡匣驗收規格比較；再在天線上以「hot load–sky」切換量出 T_sys，核對與大氣模型推算的 T_sys 是否一致。","observationEn":"How to cross-check: Measure T_rx by the Y-factor method with hot and cold loads (a room-temperature absorber and a 77 K liquid-nitrogen load), T_rx = (T_hot − Y·T_cold)/(Y − 1), scanned across each band's IF range and compared with the cartridge acceptance specification; then on the antenna switch between the hot load and sky to obtain T_sys and check it against the value predicted from the atmospheric model.","failure":"計算陷阱：單位換算錯誤、把教學假設當成設備規格，或只看結果不檢查數量級，都會讓後續設計判斷失準。","failureEn":"Calculation traps: unit conversion slips, treating teaching assumptions as equipment specifications, or accepting a result without checking its magnitude will mislead later design decisions.","check":"重現模型中的數值（取整誤差在 ±5% 內），並提交一個參數改變後的敏感度計算與物理解釋。","checkEn":"Reproduce the model values (within ±5% rounding) and submit a sensitivity calculation for one changed parameter with a physical explanation.","knowledge":[{"id":"a494-v12-14-k1","title":"定量模型","titleEn":"Quantitative model","text":"量子極限 T_q = hν/k 在 345 GHz 為 6.626×10⁻³⁴×3.45×10¹¹/1.381×10⁻²³ ≈ 16.6 K；取接收機溫度 T_rx = 70 K（約 4 倍量子極限，教學假設）。系統溫度以大氣外為參考：T_sys ≈ (T_rx + T_sky)/exp(−τ₀A)。天頂（T_sky = 36 K、透射率 0.861）時 T_sys ≈ 106/0.861 ≈ 123 K；A = 2（T_sky = 67 K、透射率 0.741）時 T_sys ≈ 137/0.741 ≈ 185 K。","textEn":"The quantum limit T_q = hν/k at 345 GHz is 6.626×10⁻³⁴×3.45×10¹¹/1.381×10⁻²³ ≈ 16.6 K; take a receiver temperature T_rx = 70 K (about four times the quantum limit, a teaching assumption). Referred to above the atmosphere, T_sys ≈ (T_rx + T_sky)/exp(−τ₀A). At zenith (T_sky = 36 K, transmission 0.861) T_sys ≈ 106/0.861 ≈ 123 K; at A = 2 (T_sky = 67 K, transmission 0.741) T_sys ≈ 137/0.741 ≈ 185 K.","sourceIds":["v12o-alma-about","v12o-alma-antennas","v12o-eso-alma","v12o-nrao-alma"]},{"id":"a494-v12-14-k2","title":"模型邊界","titleEn":"Model boundary","text":"本步數值為教學假設；套用到實際設備前，必須重新取得規格、操作條件與不確定度。","textEn":"These numbers are teaching assumptions; before applying them to real equipment, obtain the actual specifications, operating conditions and uncertainties.","sourceIds":["v12o-alma-about","v12o-alma-antennas","v12o-eso-alma","v12o-nrao-alma"]}],"quiz":{"question":"依「前端接收機：SIS 混頻器與系統溫度」的定量模型，下列哪一項敘述成立？","questionEn":"According to the quantitative model for \"Front-end receivers: SIS mixers and system temperature\", which statement holds?","options":["天線數加倍，靈敏度就恰好加倍。","只要天線夠大，站址高度對毫米波觀測影響不大。","量子極限 T_q = hν/k 在 345 GHz 為 6.626×10⁻³⁴×3.45×10¹¹/1.381×10⁻²³ ≈ 16.6 K。"],"optionsEn":["Doubling the number of antennas exactly doubles the sensitivity.","With big enough antennas, site altitude hardly matters at millimetre wavelengths.","The quantum limit T_q = hν/k at 345 GHz is 6.626×10⁻³⁴×3.45×10¹¹/1.381×10⁻²³ ≈ 16.6 K."],"answer":2,"explanation":"量子極限 T_q = hν/k 在 345 GHz 為 6.626×10⁻³⁴×3.45×10¹¹/1.381×10⁻²³ ≈ 16.6 K；取接收機溫度 T_rx = 70 K（約 4 倍量子極限，教學假設）。 重算時請保留單位。","explanationEn":"The quantum limit T_q = hν/k at 345 GHz is 6.626×10⁻³⁴×3.45×10¹¹/1.381×10⁻²³ ≈ 16.6 K; take a receiver temperature T_rx = 70 K (about four times the quantum limit, a teaching assumption). Keep units when recalculating."},"unit":4,"unitFacet":"model","order":6,"sequence":14},{"id":"a494-v12-15","title":"前端接收機：SIS 混頻器與系統溫度：量測與驗證","titleEn":"Front-end receivers: SIS mixers and system temperature: measurement and verification","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-alma-about","v12o-alma-antennas","v12o-eso-alma","v12o-nrao-alma"],"prerequisiteIds":["a494-v12-14"],"objective":"設計一項可重複的量測，驗證「4 K 低溫恆溫器與 SIS 混頻器」是否符合模型預期，並訂出允收準則。","objectiveEn":"Design a repeatable measurement that verifies whether “4 K cryostat and SIS mixers” meets the model expectation, and set acceptance criteria.","instruction":"以熱／冷負載（室溫吸收體與 77 K 液氮負載）做 Y 因子量測：T_rx = (T_hot − Y·T_cold)/(Y − 1)，在每個波段的中頻範圍掃描並與卡匣驗收規格比較；再在天線上以「hot load–sky」切換量出 T_sys，核對與大氣模型推算的 T_sys 是否一致。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成量測計畫，列出儀器、基準件或參考樣品、步驟、比較對象與允收準則，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。","instructionEn":"Measure T_rx by the Y-factor method with hot and cold loads (a room-temperature absorber and a 77 K liquid-nitrogen load), T_rx = (T_hot − Y·T_cold)/(Y − 1), scanned across each band's IF range and compared with the cartridge acceptance specification; then on the antenna switch between the hot load and sky to obtain T_sys and check it against the value predicted from the atmospheric model. Mentor task: turn this into a measurement plan listing instruments, reference artefacts or samples, procedure, comparison baseline and acceptance criteria, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.","observation":"注意干擾：LO 功率偏移使 SIS 接面偏離最佳泵浦點時，混頻器增益與雜訊同時劣化，T_rx 可在數分鐘內翻倍；若監控只看 IF 總功率而不看泵浦電流，這種退化會被誤判為天氣變差。","observationEn":"Watch for interference: If the LO power drifts and the SIS junction leaves its optimum pump point, mixer gain and noise degrade together and T_rx can double within minutes; monitoring only total IF power rather than the pump current misreads this degradation as worsening weather.","failure":"驗證陷阱：只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄環境條件，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。","failureEn":"Verification traps: a single measurement, no traceable reference, or unrecorded environmental conditions make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.","check":"提交量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格。","checkEn":"Submit the measurement plan: instruments, reference, procedure, acceptance criteria and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail decision rule.","knowledge":[{"id":"a494-v12-15-k1","title":"驗證方法","titleEn":"Verification method","text":"以熱／冷負載（室溫吸收體與 77 K 液氮負載）做 Y 因子量測：T_rx = (T_hot − Y·T_cold)/(Y − 1)，在每個波段的中頻範圍掃描並與卡匣驗收規格比較；再在天線上以「hot load–sky」切換量出 T_sys，核對與大氣模型推算的 T_sys 是否一致。","textEn":"Measure T_rx by the Y-factor method with hot and cold loads (a room-temperature absorber and a 77 K liquid-nitrogen load), T_rx = (T_hot − Y·T_cold)/(Y − 1), scanned across each band's IF range and compared with the cartridge acceptance specification; then on the antenna switch between the hot load and sky to obtain T_sys and check it against the value predicted from the atmospheric model.","sourceIds":["v12o-alma-about","v12o-alma-antennas","v12o-eso-alma","v12o-nrao-alma"]},{"id":"a494-v12-15-k2","title":"允收與不確定度","titleEn":"Acceptance and uncertainty","text":"允收準則必須在量測前訂定，並與擴充不確定度一起陳述；比較基準需可追溯。","textEn":"Acceptance criteria are fixed before measuring and stated together with expanded uncertainty; the comparison reference must be traceable.","sourceIds":["v12o-alma-about","v12o-alma-antennas","v12o-eso-alma","v12o-nrao-alma"]}],"quiz":{"question":"要驗證「前端接收機：SIS 混頻器與系統溫度」，下列哪一個做法最恰當？","questionEn":"Which approach best verifies \"Front-end receivers: SIS mixers and system temperature\"?","options":["以熱／冷負載（室溫吸收體與 77 K 液氮負載）做 Y 因子量測：T_rx = (T_hot − Y·T_cold)/(Y − 1)，在每個波段的中頻範圍掃描並與卡匣驗收規格比較。","不確定度太難估計，報告中只寫最佳值即可。","基線越長影像品質一定越好，短基線只是備用。"],"optionsEn":["Measure T_rx by the Y-factor method with hot and cold loads (a room-temperature absorber and a 77 K liquid-nitrogen load), T_rx = (T_hot − Y·T_cold)/(Y − 1), scanned across each band's IF range and compared with the cartridge acceptance specification.","Uncertainty is too hard to estimate, so the report may state only the best value.","Longer baselines always give better images; short baselines are just backup."],"answer":0,"explanation":"以熱／冷負載（室溫吸收體與 77 K 液氮負載）做 Y 因子量測：T_rx = (T_hot − Y·T_cold)/(Y − 1)，在每個波段的中頻範圍掃描並與卡匣驗收規格比較；再在天線上以「hot load–sky」切換量出 T_sys，核對與大氣模型推算的 T_sys 是否一致。 驗證需要基準、重複性與允收準則。","explanationEn":"Measure T_rx by the Y-factor method with hot and cold loads (a room-temperature absorber and a 77 K liquid-nitrogen load), T_rx = (T_hot − Y·T_cold)/(Y − 1), scanned across each band's IF range and compared with the cartridge acceptance specification; then on the antenna switch between the hot load and sky to obtain T_sys and check it against the value predicted from the atmospheric model. Verification needs a reference, repeatability and acceptance criteria."},"unit":4,"unitFacet":"verification","order":7,"sequence":15},{"id":"a494-v12-16","title":"前端接收機：SIS 混頻器與系統溫度：失效診斷","titleEn":"Front-end receivers: SIS mixers and system temperature: failure diagnosis","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-alma-about","v12o-alma-antennas","v12o-eso-alma","v12o-nrao-alma"],"prerequisiteIds":["a494-v12-15"],"objective":"從症狀倒推「4 K 低溫恆溫器與 SIS 混頻器」的失效原因，提出能區分原因的檢查與矯正措施。","objectiveEn":"Work back from symptoms to the failure causes of “4 K cryostat and SIS mixers” and propose discriminating checks and corrective actions.","instruction":"LO 功率偏移使 SIS 接面偏離最佳泵浦點時，混頻器增益與雜訊同時劣化，T_rx 可在數分鐘內翻倍；若監控只看 IF 總功率而不看泵浦電流，這種退化會被誤判為天氣變差。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整個系統的性能、良率或安全。","instructionEn":"If the LO power drifts and the SIS junction leaves its optimum pump point, mixer gain and noise degrade together and T_rx can double within minutes; monitoring only total IF power rather than the pump current misreads this degradation as worsening weather. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-system performance, yield or safety.","observation":"連結機制：LO 參考由中央光子產生器經光纖分送到各天線並鎖相，以保持陣列相位一致。","observationEn":"Link to the mechanism: The LO reference is generated photonically at the central building, distributed over fibre to every antenna and phase-locked to keep the array coherent.","failure":"誤判風險：若相信「接收機冷到 4 K 之後，系統溫度就只剩天空的貢獻。」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。","failureEn":"Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"Once the receiver is at 4 K, the system temperature is only the sky's contribution.\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.","check":"完成失效樹與矯正措施，並指出哪一項量測能最快確認根因、如何防止再發。","checkEn":"Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement that confirms the root cause fastest, and state how recurrence is prevented.","knowledge":[{"id":"a494-v12-16-k1","title":"失效模式","titleEn":"Failure mode","text":"LO 功率偏移使 SIS 接面偏離最佳泵浦點時，混頻器增益與雜訊同時劣化，T_rx 可在數分鐘內翻倍；若監控只看 IF 總功率而不看泵浦電流，這種退化會被誤判為天氣變差。","textEn":"If the LO power drifts and the SIS junction leaves its optimum pump point, mixer gain and noise degrade together and T_rx can double within minutes; monitoring only total IF power rather than the pump current misreads this degradation as worsening weather.","sourceIds":["v12o-alma-about","v12o-alma-antennas","v12o-eso-alma","v12o-nrao-alma"]},{"id":"a494-v12-16-k2","title":"根因確認","titleEn":"Root-cause confirmation","text":"根因必須以可區分的量測確認；只更換零件或放寬參數可能掩蓋問題。","textEn":"Confirm the root cause with a discriminating measurement; merely swapping parts or relaxing limits can mask the problem.","sourceIds":["v12o-alma-about","v12o-alma-antennas","v12o-eso-alma","v12o-nrao-alma"]}],"quiz":{"question":"在「前端接收機：SIS 混頻器與系統溫度」出現異常時，下列哪一項判斷最合理？","questionEn":"When \"Front-end receivers: SIS mixers and system temperature\" misbehaves, which diagnosis is most reasonable?","options":["先更換最貴的零件；只要症狀消失，就代表已找到根因。","LO 功率偏移使 SIS 接面偏離最佳泵浦點時，混頻器增益與雜訊同時劣化，T_rx 可在數分鐘內翻倍。","乾燥站址上的大氣相位是穩定的，只要校正一次即可。"],"optionsEn":["Replace the most expensive part first; if the symptom disappears, the root cause has been found.","If the LO power drifts and the SIS junction leaves its optimum pump point, mixer gain and noise degrade together and T_rx can double within minutes.","At a dry site the atmospheric phase is stable, so one calibration is enough."],"answer":1,"explanation":"LO 功率偏移使 SIS 接面偏離最佳泵浦點時，混頻器增益與雜訊同時劣化，T_rx 可在數分鐘內翻倍；若監控只看 IF 總功率而不看泵浦電流，這種退化會被誤判為天氣變差。 需以量測區分可能原因。","explanationEn":"If the LO power drifts and the SIS junction leaves its optimum pump point, mixer gain and noise degrade together and T_rx can double within minutes; monitoring only total IF power rather than the pump current misreads this degradation as worsening weather. Discriminate candidate causes by measurement."},"unit":4,"unitFacet":"failure","order":8,"sequence":16}],"order":2},{"id":"a494-v12-s3","title":"量測、校正與誤差預算","titleEn":"Measurement, calibration and error budgets","description":"本階段聚焦「水汽相位起伏與輻射計校正」與「流量、頻寬、指向與基線的誤差預算」：先建立機制與定量模型，再設計驗證並診斷失效。","descriptionEn":"This stage covers \"Water-vapour phase fluctuations and radiometric correction\" and \"Flux, bandpass, pointing and baseline error budgets\": build the mechanism and quantitative model first, then design verification and diagnose failures.","steps":[{"id":"a494-v12-17","title":"水汽相位起伏與輻射計校正：原理與系統邊界","titleEn":"Water-vapour phase fluctuations and radiometric correction: mechanism and system boundary","estimatedMinutes":20,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-alma-about","v12o-alma-antennas","v12o-eso-alma","v12o-nrao-alma"],"prerequisiteIds":["a494-v12-16"],"objective":"說明「183 GHz 水汽輻射計」如何決定ALMA 大型毫米及次毫米波陣列的關鍵性能，並畫出其輸入、輸出與邊界。","objectiveEn":"Explain how “183 GHz water-vapour radiometer” determines the key performance of “Atacama Large Millimeter/submillimeter Array”, and map its inputs, outputs and boundaries.","instruction":"水汽的折射率使電波在大氣中多走一段「濕路徑」，約為每毫米 PWV 多出 6.5 mm 的等效路徑。兩座天線上方的水汽量因亂流而不同且隨秒級時間變化，造成基線相位的隨機起伏，在次毫米波段一小段路徑差就是好幾個波長，相干性會被摧毀。每座 12 m 天線因此裝有 183 GHz 水汽輻射計，以約 1 s 的節奏量測視線上的水汽發射，推算瞬時濕路徑並在相關後資料中逐一修正相位；殘餘的慢變化再以快速切換校正源（phase referencing）去除。 師傅任務：以方塊圖畫出能量或訊號通過「183 GHz 水汽輻射計」的路徑，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由環境或製造決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。","instructionEn":"The refractive index of water vapour adds a wet path to the radio signal, roughly 6.5 mm of excess path per millimetre of PWV. The vapour above two antennas differs because of turbulence and changes on second time scales, producing random baseline phase fluctuations; at submillimetre wavelengths a small path difference is several wavelengths and coherence is destroyed. Each 12 m antenna therefore carries a 183 GHz water-vapour radiometer that measures line-of-sight vapour emission about once per second, infers the instantaneous wet path and corrects the phase of the correlated data sample by sample; the remaining slow drift is removed by fast switching to a phase calibrator. Mentor task: draw a block diagram of the energy or signal path through “183 GHz water-vapour radiometer”, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by environment or fabrication, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.","observation":"量級提示：相位誤差 φ = 2π·ΔL/λ。","observationEn":"Order-of-magnitude cue: Phase error φ = 2π·ΔL/λ.","failure":"常見誤解：「乾燥站址上的大氣相位是穩定的，只要校正一次即可。」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在方塊圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。","failureEn":"Common misconception: \"At a dry site the atmospheric phase is stable, so one calibration is enough.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your block diagram where it breaks down.","check":"方塊圖標明「183 GHz 水汽輻射計」的輸入、輸出與邊界；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。","checkEn":"The block diagram shows inputs, outputs and boundaries of “183 GHz water-vapour radiometer”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.","knowledge":[{"id":"a494-v12-17-k1","title":"水汽相位起伏與輻射計校正","titleEn":"Water-vapour phase fluctuations and radiometric correction","text":"水汽的折射率使電波在大氣中多走一段「濕路徑」，約為每毫米 PWV 多出 6.5 mm 的等效路徑。兩座天線上方的水汽量因亂流而不同且隨秒級時間變化，造成基線相位的隨機起伏，在次毫米波段一小段路徑差就是好幾個波長，相干性會被摧毀。","textEn":"The refractive index of water vapour adds a wet path to the radio signal, roughly 6.5 mm of excess path per millimetre of PWV. The vapour above two antennas differs because of turbulence and changes on second time scales, producing random baseline phase fluctuations; at submillimetre wavelengths a small path difference is several wavelengths and coherence is destroyed.","sourceIds":["v12o-alma-about","v12o-alma-antennas","v12o-eso-alma","v12o-nrao-alma"]},{"id":"a494-v12-17-k2","title":"誤解辨析","titleEn":"Misconception check","text":"誤解：乾燥站址上的大氣相位是穩定的，只要校正一次即可。 正確的工程判斷必須回到機制與量級。","textEn":"Misconception: At a dry site the atmospheric phase is stable, so one calibration is enough. Sound engineering judgement goes back to mechanism and magnitude.","sourceIds":["v12o-alma-about","v12o-alma-antennas","v12o-eso-alma","v12o-nrao-alma"]}],"quiz":{"question":"關於「水汽相位起伏與輻射計校正」，下列哪一項敘述正確？","questionEn":"Which statement about \"Water-vapour phase fluctuations and radiometric correction\" is correct?","options":["乾燥站址上的大氣相位是穩定的，只要校正一次即可。","流量校正用的行星是理想點源，不需要模型。","水汽的折射率使電波在大氣中多走一段「濕路徑」，約為每毫米 PWV 多出 6.5 mm 的等效路徑。"],"optionsEn":["At a dry site the atmospheric phase is stable, so one calibration is enough.","Planets used for flux calibration are ideal point sources and need no model.","The refractive index of water vapour adds a wet path to the radio signal, roughly 6.5 mm of excess path per millimetre of PWV."],"answer":2,"explanation":"水汽的折射率使電波在大氣中多走一段「濕路徑」，約為每毫米 PWV 多出 6.5 mm 的等效路徑。 其餘選項是常見誤解。","explanationEn":"The refractive index of water vapour adds a wet path to the radio signal, roughly 6.5 mm of excess path per millimetre of PWV. The other options are common misconceptions."},"unit":5,"unitFacet":"mechanism","order":1,"sequence":17},{"id":"a494-v12-18","title":"水汽相位起伏與輻射計校正：定量估算","titleEn":"Water-vapour phase fluctuations and radiometric correction: quantitative estimate","estimatedMinutes":30,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-alma-about","v12o-alma-antennas","v12o-eso-alma","v12o-nrao-alma"],"prerequisiteIds":["a494-v12-17"],"objective":"以數值模型估算「183 GHz 水汽輻射計」的關鍵量，並判斷參數改變時結果的方向與幅度。","objectiveEn":"Estimate the key quantities of “183 GHz water-vapour radiometer” with a numerical model and judge the direction and size of changes when a parameter moves.","instruction":"依下列模型逐步重算：相位誤差 φ = 2π·ΔL/λ。若兩天線間 PWV 差 0.1 mm，ΔL ≈ 0.65 mm，在 λ = 0.87 mm 時 φ = 2π×0.65/0.87 ≈ 4.7 rad ≈ 269°，完全失相干；WVR 修正後殘餘路徑 15 µm 時 φ ≈ 0.108 rad ≈ 6.2°。相干損失因子 exp(−σ_φ²/2)：σ_φ = 0.108 rad 時為 0.994，σ_φ = 0.72 rad（殘餘 100 µm）時僅 0.77。 師傅任務：保留單位重算一次，再只改變一個輸入（例如增加 10%），預測並計算輸出的變化，說明它是線性、平方或更高次方的關係。","instructionEn":"Recalculate step by step: Phase error φ = 2π·ΔL/λ. A 0.1 mm PWV difference between two antennas gives ΔL ≈ 0.65 mm, which at λ = 0.87 mm is φ = 2π×0.65/0.87 ≈ 4.7 rad ≈ 269°, total decoherence; after WVR correction a 15 µm residual gives φ ≈ 0.108 rad ≈ 6.2°. The coherence factor exp(−σ_φ²/2) is 0.994 for σ_φ = 0.108 rad but only 0.77 for σ_φ = 0.72 rad (a 100 µm residual). Mentor task: redo the calculation keeping units, then change one input (for example by +10%), predict and compute the output change, and state whether the dependence is linear, quadratic or steeper.","observation":"如何核對：對強校正源做長時間相位追蹤，分別計算套用 WVR 修正前後的相位 RMS 與相干損失，並畫出相位結構函數對基線長度的關係；WVR 修正應使長基線的相位 RMS 明顯下降，而殘餘量應與輻射計的路徑雜訊規格（約 10 µm 加上 2% 的起伏量）相符。","observationEn":"How to cross-check: Track the phase of a strong calibrator for a long interval, compute the phase RMS and coherence loss with and without the WVR correction, and plot the phase structure function against baseline length; the WVR correction should clearly reduce the long-baseline phase RMS, and the residual should match the radiometer path-noise specification of about 10 µm plus 2% of the fluctuation.","failure":"計算陷阱：單位換算錯誤、把教學假設當成設備規格，或只看結果不檢查數量級，都會讓後續設計判斷失準。","failureEn":"Calculation traps: unit conversion slips, treating teaching assumptions as equipment specifications, or accepting a result without checking its magnitude will mislead later design decisions.","check":"重現模型中的數值（取整誤差在 ±5% 內），並提交一個參數改變後的敏感度計算與物理解釋。","checkEn":"Reproduce the model values (within ±5% rounding) and submit a sensitivity calculation for one changed parameter with a physical explanation.","knowledge":[{"id":"a494-v12-18-k1","title":"定量模型","titleEn":"Quantitative model","text":"相位誤差 φ = 2π·ΔL/λ。若兩天線間 PWV 差 0.1 mm，ΔL ≈ 0.65 mm，在 λ = 0.87 mm 時 φ = 2π×0.65/0.87 ≈ 4.7 rad ≈ 269°，完全失相干；WVR 修正後殘餘路徑 15 µm 時 φ ≈ 0.108 rad ≈ 6.2°。相干損失因子 exp(−σ_φ²/2)：σ_φ = 0.108 rad 時為 0.994，σ_φ = 0.72 rad（殘餘 100 µm）時僅 0.77。","textEn":"Phase error φ = 2π·ΔL/λ. A 0.1 mm PWV difference between two antennas gives ΔL ≈ 0.65 mm, which at λ = 0.87 mm is φ = 2π×0.65/0.87 ≈ 4.7 rad ≈ 269°, total decoherence; after WVR correction a 15 µm residual gives φ ≈ 0.108 rad ≈ 6.2°. The coherence factor exp(−σ_φ²/2) is 0.994 for σ_φ = 0.108 rad but only 0.77 for σ_φ = 0.72 rad (a 100 µm residual).","sourceIds":["v12o-alma-about","v12o-alma-antennas","v12o-eso-alma","v12o-nrao-alma"]},{"id":"a494-v12-18-k2","title":"模型邊界","titleEn":"Model boundary","text":"本步數值為教學假設；套用到實際設備前，必須重新取得規格、操作條件與不確定度。","textEn":"These numbers are teaching assumptions; before applying them to real equipment, obtain the actual specifications, operating conditions and uncertainties.","sourceIds":["v12o-alma-about","v12o-alma-antennas","v12o-eso-alma","v12o-nrao-alma"]}],"quiz":{"question":"依「水汽相位起伏與輻射計校正」的定量模型，下列哪一項敘述成立？","questionEn":"According to the quantitative model for \"Water-vapour phase fluctuations and radiometric correction\", which statement holds?","options":["相位誤差 φ = 2π·ΔL/λ。","每座天線各自通過驗收，陣列就自動可以做科學觀測。","基線越長影像品質一定越好，短基線只是備用。"],"optionsEn":["Phase error φ = 2π·ΔL/λ.","If every antenna passes its own acceptance, the array is automatically ready for science.","Longer baselines always give better images; short baselines are just backup."],"answer":0,"explanation":"相位誤差 φ = 2π·ΔL/λ。 重算時請保留單位。","explanationEn":"Phase error φ = 2π·ΔL/λ. Keep units when recalculating."},"unit":5,"unitFacet":"model","order":2,"sequence":18},{"id":"a494-v12-19","title":"水汽相位起伏與輻射計校正：量測與驗證","titleEn":"Water-vapour phase fluctuations and radiometric correction: measurement and verification","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-alma-about","v12o-alma-antennas","v12o-eso-alma","v12o-nrao-alma"],"prerequisiteIds":["a494-v12-18"],"objective":"設計一項可重複的量測，驗證「183 GHz 水汽輻射計」是否符合模型預期，並訂出允收準則。","objectiveEn":"Design a repeatable measurement that verifies whether “183 GHz water-vapour radiometer” meets the model expectation, and set acceptance criteria.","instruction":"對強校正源做長時間相位追蹤，分別計算套用 WVR 修正前後的相位 RMS 與相干損失，並畫出相位結構函數對基線長度的關係；WVR 修正應使長基線的相位 RMS 明顯下降，而殘餘量應與輻射計的路徑雜訊規格（約 10 µm 加上 2% 的起伏量）相符。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成量測計畫，列出儀器、基準件或參考樣品、步驟、比較對象與允收準則，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。","instructionEn":"Track the phase of a strong calibrator for a long interval, compute the phase RMS and coherence loss with and without the WVR correction, and plot the phase structure function against baseline length; the WVR correction should clearly reduce the long-baseline phase RMS, and the residual should match the radiometer path-noise specification of about 10 µm plus 2% of the fluctuation. Mentor task: turn this into a measurement plan listing instruments, reference artefacts or samples, procedure, comparison baseline and acceptance criteria, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.","observation":"注意干擾：雲層或液態水出現時，183 GHz 發射不再只來自水汽，輻射計推算的濕路徑偏高，套用修正反而把相位弄得更差；若流程沒有偵測液態水並關閉修正，長基線影像會模糊且峰值流量下降。","observationEn":"Watch for interference: When clouds or liquid water are present the 183 GHz emission no longer comes only from vapour, the inferred wet path is too large and applying the correction makes the phase worse; if the pipeline does not detect liquid water and disable the correction, long-baseline images blur and peak fluxes drop.","failure":"驗證陷阱：只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄環境條件，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。","failureEn":"Verification traps: a single measurement, no traceable reference, or unrecorded environmental conditions make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.","check":"提交量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格。","checkEn":"Submit the measurement plan: instruments, reference, procedure, acceptance criteria and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail decision rule.","knowledge":[{"id":"a494-v12-19-k1","title":"驗證方法","titleEn":"Verification method","text":"對強校正源做長時間相位追蹤，分別計算套用 WVR 修正前後的相位 RMS 與相干損失，並畫出相位結構函數對基線長度的關係；WVR 修正應使長基線的相位 RMS 明顯下降，而殘餘量應與輻射計的路徑雜訊規格（約 10 µm 加上 2% 的起伏量）相符。","textEn":"Track the phase of a strong calibrator for a long interval, compute the phase RMS and coherence loss with and without the WVR correction, and plot the phase structure function against baseline length; the WVR correction should clearly reduce the long-baseline phase RMS, and the residual should match the radiometer path-noise specification of about 10 µm plus 2% of the fluctuation.","sourceIds":["v12o-alma-about","v12o-alma-antennas","v12o-eso-alma","v12o-nrao-alma"]},{"id":"a494-v12-19-k2","title":"允收與不確定度","titleEn":"Acceptance and uncertainty","text":"允收準則必須在量測前訂定，並與擴充不確定度一起陳述；比較基準需可追溯。","textEn":"Acceptance criteria are fixed before measuring and stated together with expanded uncertainty; the comparison reference must be traceable.","sourceIds":["v12o-alma-about","v12o-alma-antennas","v12o-eso-alma","v12o-nrao-alma"]}],"quiz":{"question":"要驗證「水汽相位起伏與輻射計校正」，下列哪一個做法最恰當？","questionEn":"Which approach best verifies \"Water-vapour phase fluctuations and radiometric correction\"?","options":["允收準則可以等看到量測數據後再決定。","對強校正源做長時間相位追蹤，分別計算套用 WVR 修正前後的相位 RMS 與相干損失，並畫出相位結構函數對基線長度的關係。","25 µm 的面形精度對 ALMA 所有波段都綽綽有餘。"],"optionsEn":["Acceptance criteria can be decided after the measured data have been seen.","Track the phase of a strong calibrator for a long interval, compute the phase RMS and coherence loss with and without the WVR correction, and plot the phase structure function against baseline length.","A 25 µm surface is more than good enough for every ALMA band."],"answer":1,"explanation":"對強校正源做長時間相位追蹤，分別計算套用 WVR 修正前後的相位 RMS 與相干損失，並畫出相位結構函數對基線長度的關係；WVR 修正應使長基線的相位 RMS 明顯下降，而殘餘量應與輻射計的路徑雜訊規格（約 10 µm 加上 2% 的起伏量）相符。 驗證需要基準、重複性與允收準則。","explanationEn":"Track the phase of a strong calibrator for a long interval, compute the phase RMS and coherence loss with and without the WVR correction, and plot the phase structure function against baseline length; the WVR correction should clearly reduce the long-baseline phase RMS, and the residual should match the radiometer path-noise specification of about 10 µm plus 2% of the fluctuation. Verification needs a reference, repeatability and acceptance criteria."},"unit":5,"unitFacet":"verification","order":3,"sequence":19},{"id":"a494-v12-20","title":"水汽相位起伏與輻射計校正：失效診斷","titleEn":"Water-vapour phase fluctuations and radiometric correction: failure diagnosis","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-alma-about","v12o-alma-antennas","v12o-eso-alma","v12o-nrao-alma"],"prerequisiteIds":["a494-v12-19"],"objective":"從症狀倒推「183 GHz 水汽輻射計」的失效原因，提出能區分原因的檢查與矯正措施。","objectiveEn":"Work back from symptoms to the failure causes of “183 GHz water-vapour radiometer” and propose discriminating checks and corrective actions.","instruction":"雲層或液態水出現時，183 GHz 發射不再只來自水汽，輻射計推算的濕路徑偏高，套用修正反而把相位弄得更差；若流程沒有偵測液態水並關閉修正，長基線影像會模糊且峰值流量下降。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整個系統的性能、良率或安全。","instructionEn":"When clouds or liquid water are present the 183 GHz emission no longer comes only from vapour, the inferred wet path is too large and applying the correction makes the phase worse; if the pipeline does not detect liquid water and disable the correction, long-baseline images blur and peak fluxes drop. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-system performance, yield or safety.","observation":"連結機制：每座 12 m 天線因此裝有 183 GHz 水汽輻射計，以約 1 s 的節奏量測視線上的水汽發射，推算瞬時濕路徑並在相關後資料中逐一修正相位；殘餘的慢變化再以快速切換校正源（phase referencing）去除。","observationEn":"Link to the mechanism: Each 12 m antenna therefore carries a 183 GHz water-vapour radiometer that measures line-of-sight vapour emission about once per second, infers the instantaneous wet path and corrects the phase of the correlated data sample by sample; the remaining slow drift is removed by fast switching to a phase calibrator.","failure":"誤判風險：若相信「乾燥站址上的大氣相位是穩定的，只要校正一次即可。」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。","failureEn":"Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"At a dry site the atmospheric phase is stable, so one calibration is enough.\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.","check":"完成失效樹與矯正措施，並指出哪一項量測能最快確認根因、如何防止再發。","checkEn":"Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement that confirms the root cause fastest, and state how recurrence is prevented.","knowledge":[{"id":"a494-v12-20-k1","title":"失效模式","titleEn":"Failure mode","text":"雲層或液態水出現時，183 GHz 發射不再只來自水汽，輻射計推算的濕路徑偏高，套用修正反而把相位弄得更差；若流程沒有偵測液態水並關閉修正，長基線影像會模糊且峰值流量下降。","textEn":"When clouds or liquid water are present the 183 GHz emission no longer comes only from vapour, the inferred wet path is too large and applying the correction makes the phase worse; if the pipeline does not detect liquid water and disable the correction, long-baseline images blur and peak fluxes drop.","sourceIds":["v12o-alma-about","v12o-alma-antennas","v12o-eso-alma","v12o-nrao-alma"]},{"id":"a494-v12-20-k2","title":"根因確認","titleEn":"Root-cause confirmation","text":"根因必須以可區分的量測確認；只更換零件或放寬參數可能掩蓋問題。","textEn":"Confirm the root cause with a discriminating measurement; merely swapping parts or relaxing limits can mask the problem.","sourceIds":["v12o-alma-about","v12o-alma-antennas","v12o-eso-alma","v12o-nrao-alma"]}],"quiz":{"question":"在「水汽相位起伏與輻射計校正」出現異常時，下列哪一項判斷最合理？","questionEn":"When \"Water-vapour phase fluctuations and radiometric correction\" misbehaves, which diagnosis is most reasonable?","options":["症狀相同就代表原因相同，不必用量測區分。","流量校正用的行星是理想點源，不需要模型。","雲層或液態水出現時，183 GHz 發射不再只來自水汽，輻射計推算的濕路徑偏高，套用修正反而把相位弄得更差。"],"optionsEn":["Identical symptoms always mean identical causes, so no discriminating measurement is needed.","Planets used for flux calibration are ideal point sources and need no model.","When clouds or liquid water are present the 183 GHz emission no longer comes only from vapour, the inferred wet path is too large and applying the correction makes the phase worse."],"answer":2,"explanation":"雲層或液態水出現時，183 GHz 發射不再只來自水汽，輻射計推算的濕路徑偏高，套用修正反而把相位弄得更差；若流程沒有偵測液態水並關閉修正，長基線影像會模糊且峰值流量下降。 需以量測區分可能原因。","explanationEn":"When clouds or liquid water are present the 183 GHz emission no longer comes only from vapour, the inferred wet path is too large and applying the correction makes the phase worse; if the pipeline does not detect liquid water and disable the correction, long-baseline images blur and peak fluxes drop. Discriminate candidate causes by measurement."},"unit":5,"unitFacet":"failure","order":4,"sequence":20},{"id":"a494-v12-21","title":"流量、頻寬、指向與基線的誤差預算：原理與系統邊界","titleEn":"Flux, bandpass, pointing and baseline error budgets: mechanism and system boundary","estimatedMinutes":20,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-alma-about","v12o-alma-antennas","v12o-eso-alma","v12o-nrao-alma"],"prerequisiteIds":["a494-v12-20"],"objective":"說明「校正鏈與誤差預算表」如何決定ALMA 大型毫米及次毫米波陣列的關鍵性能，並畫出其輸入、輸出與邊界。","objectiveEn":"Explain how “Calibration chain and error-budget table” determines the key performance of “Atacama Large Millimeter/submillimeter Array”, and map its inputs, outputs and boundaries.","instruction":"ALMA 的每次觀測都包含一組校正：以行星或衛星與監測過的類星體定流量尺度，以強連續譜源定頻寬響應，以鄰近類星體做相位參考，並定期做指向與焦點校正。天線在搬移後的位置（基線向量）要以多個類星體的相位解到次毫米精度，否則校正源與目標之間的相位會隨角距離產生系統誤差。工程師要把這些項目列成誤差預算，量化每一項對振幅與相位的貢獻，才知道影像的流量不確定度（通常 5–10%）由誰主導。 師傅任務：以方塊圖畫出能量或訊號通過「校正鏈與誤差預算表」的路徑，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由環境或製造決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。","instructionEn":"Every ALMA observation carries a calibration set: the flux scale from planets or moons and monitored quasars, the bandpass from a strong continuum source, phase referencing on a nearby quasar, and periodic pointing and focus checks. After antennas are moved, their positions (baseline vectors) must be solved from the phases of several quasars to submillimetre precision, otherwise the phase between calibrator and target drifts systematically with their angular separation. The engineer tabulates these items in an error budget, quantifying each contribution to amplitude and phase, to learn which term dominates the image flux uncertainty, typically 5–10%. Mentor task: draw a block diagram of the energy or signal path through “Calibration chain and error-budget table”, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by environment or fabrication, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.","observation":"量級提示：指向損失（高斯波束）≈ exp[−4ln2·(δ/θ_PB)²]：δ = 0.6″ 在 345 GHz（θ_PB = 16.9″）時損失僅 0.35%，在 950 GHz（θ_PB ≈ 6.2″）時損失 2.6%。","observationEn":"Order-of-magnitude cue: Pointing loss (Gaussian beam) ≈ exp[−4ln2·(δ/θ_PB)²]: δ = 0.6″ costs only 0.35% at 345 GHz (θ_PB = 16.9″) but 2.6% at 950 GHz (θ_PB ≈ 6.2″).","failure":"常見誤解：「流量校正用的行星是理想點源，不需要模型。」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在方塊圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。","failureEn":"Common misconception: \"Planets used for flux calibration are ideal point sources and need no model.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your block diagram where it breaks down.","check":"方塊圖標明「校正鏈與誤差預算表」的輸入、輸出與邊界；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。","checkEn":"The block diagram shows inputs, outputs and boundaries of “Calibration chain and error-budget table”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.","knowledge":[{"id":"a494-v12-21-k1","title":"流量、頻寬、指向與基線的誤差預算","titleEn":"Flux, bandpass, pointing and baseline error budgets","text":"ALMA 的每次觀測都包含一組校正：以行星或衛星與監測過的類星體定流量尺度，以強連續譜源定頻寬響應，以鄰近類星體做相位參考，並定期做指向與焦點校正。天線在搬移後的位置（基線向量）要以多個類星體的相位解到次毫米精度，否則校正源與目標之間的相位會隨角距離產生系統誤差。","textEn":"Every ALMA observation carries a calibration set: the flux scale from planets or moons and monitored quasars, the bandpass from a strong continuum source, phase referencing on a nearby quasar, and periodic pointing and focus checks. After antennas are moved, their positions (baseline vectors) must be solved from the phases of several quasars to submillimetre precision, otherwise the phase between calibrator and target drifts systematically with their angular separation.","sourceIds":["v12o-alma-about","v12o-alma-antennas","v12o-eso-alma","v12o-nrao-alma"]},{"id":"a494-v12-21-k2","title":"誤解辨析","titleEn":"Misconception check","text":"誤解：流量校正用的行星是理想點源，不需要模型。 正確的工程判斷必須回到機制與量級。","textEn":"Misconception: Planets used for flux calibration are ideal point sources and need no model. Sound engineering judgement goes back to mechanism and magnitude.","sourceIds":["v12o-alma-about","v12o-alma-antennas","v12o-eso-alma","v12o-nrao-alma"]}],"quiz":{"question":"關於「流量、頻寬、指向與基線的誤差預算」，下列哪一項敘述正確？","questionEn":"Which statement about \"Flux, bandpass, pointing and baseline error budgets\" is correct?","options":["ALMA 的每次觀測都包含一組校正：以行星或衛星與監測過的類星體定流量尺度，以強連續譜源定頻寬響應，以鄰近類星體做相位參考，並定期做指向與焦點校正。","流量校正用的行星是理想點源，不需要模型。","天線數加倍，靈敏度就恰好加倍。"],"optionsEn":["Every ALMA observation carries a calibration set: the flux scale from planets or moons and monitored quasars, the bandpass from a strong continuum source, phase referencing on a nearby quasar, and periodic pointing and focus checks.","Planets used for flux calibration are ideal point sources and need no model.","Doubling the number of antennas exactly doubles the sensitivity."],"answer":0,"explanation":"ALMA 的每次觀測都包含一組校正：以行星或衛星與監測過的類星體定流量尺度，以強連續譜源定頻寬響應，以鄰近類星體做相位參考，並定期做指向與焦點校正。 其餘選項是常見誤解。","explanationEn":"Every ALMA observation carries a calibration set: the flux scale from planets or moons and monitored quasars, the bandpass from a strong continuum source, phase referencing on a nearby quasar, and periodic pointing and focus checks. The other options are common misconceptions."},"unit":6,"unitFacet":"mechanism","order":5,"sequence":21},{"id":"a494-v12-22","title":"流量、頻寬、指向與基線的誤差預算：定量估算","titleEn":"Flux, bandpass, pointing and baseline error budgets: quantitative estimate","estimatedMinutes":30,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-alma-about","v12o-alma-antennas","v12o-eso-alma","v12o-nrao-alma"],"prerequisiteIds":["a494-v12-21"],"objective":"以數值模型估算「校正鏈與誤差預算表」的關鍵量，並判斷參數改變時結果的方向與幅度。","objectiveEn":"Estimate the key quantities of “Calibration chain and error-budget table” with a numerical model and judge the direction and size of changes when a parameter moves.","instruction":"依下列模型逐步重算：指向損失（高斯波束）≈ exp[−4ln2·(δ/θ_PB)²]：δ = 0.6″ 在 345 GHz（θ_PB = 16.9″）時損失僅 0.35%，在 950 GHz（θ_PB ≈ 6.2″）時損失 2.6%。基線誤差 ε_b 造成的相位誤差 φ ≈ 2π·ε_b·sinθ_sep/λ：ε_b = 0.1 mm、校正源與目標相距 2°、λ = 0.87 mm 時 φ ≈ 0.025 rad ≈ 1.4°。 師傅任務：保留單位重算一次，再只改變一個輸入（例如增加 10%），預測並計算輸出的變化，說明它是線性、平方或更高次方的關係。","instructionEn":"Recalculate step by step: Pointing loss (Gaussian beam) ≈ exp[−4ln2·(δ/θ_PB)²]: δ = 0.6″ costs only 0.35% at 345 GHz (θ_PB = 16.9″) but 2.6% at 950 GHz (θ_PB ≈ 6.2″). A baseline error ε_b gives a phase error φ ≈ 2π·ε_b·sinθ_sep/λ: with ε_b = 0.1 mm, a calibrator 2° from the target and λ = 0.87 mm, φ ≈ 0.025 rad ≈ 1.4°. Mentor task: redo the calculation keeping units, then change one input (for example by +10%), predict and compute the output change, and state whether the dependence is linear, quadratic or steeper.","observation":"如何核對：在同一觀測中交替觀測兩個已知流量的校正源，把其中一個當成「未知目標」做完整校正流程，比較回復流量與目錄值的偏差；同時檢查相位參考後目標相位的殘餘斜率是否隨校正源角距離增長，若是則重解天線位置。","observationEn":"How to cross-check: Within one observation alternate between two calibrators of known flux, treat one as an unknown target, run the full calibration and compare the recovered flux with the catalogue value; also check whether the residual phase slope on the target after phase referencing grows with calibrator separation, and if so re-solve the antenna positions.","failure":"計算陷阱：單位換算錯誤、把教學假設當成設備規格，或只看結果不檢查數量級，都會讓後續設計判斷失準。","failureEn":"Calculation traps: unit conversion slips, treating teaching assumptions as equipment specifications, or accepting a result without checking its magnitude will mislead later design decisions.","check":"重現模型中的數值（取整誤差在 ±5% 內），並提交一個參數改變後的敏感度計算與物理解釋。","checkEn":"Reproduce the model values (within ±5% rounding) and submit a sensitivity calculation for one changed parameter with a physical explanation.","knowledge":[{"id":"a494-v12-22-k1","title":"定量模型","titleEn":"Quantitative model","text":"指向損失（高斯波束）≈ exp[−4ln2·(δ/θ_PB)²]：δ = 0.6″ 在 345 GHz（θ_PB = 16.9″）時損失僅 0.35%，在 950 GHz（θ_PB ≈ 6.2″）時損失 2.6%。基線誤差 ε_b 造成的相位誤差 φ ≈ 2π·ε_b·sinθ_sep/λ：ε_b = 0.1 mm、校正源與目標相距 2°、λ = 0.87 mm 時 φ ≈ 0.025 rad ≈ 1.4°。","textEn":"Pointing loss (Gaussian beam) ≈ exp[−4ln2·(δ/θ_PB)²]: δ = 0.6″ costs only 0.35% at 345 GHz (θ_PB = 16.9″) but 2.6% at 950 GHz (θ_PB ≈ 6.2″). A baseline error ε_b gives a phase error φ ≈ 2π·ε_b·sinθ_sep/λ: with ε_b = 0.1 mm, a calibrator 2° from the target and λ = 0.87 mm, φ ≈ 0.025 rad ≈ 1.4°.","sourceIds":["v12o-alma-about","v12o-alma-antennas","v12o-eso-alma","v12o-nrao-alma"]},{"id":"a494-v12-22-k2","title":"模型邊界","titleEn":"Model boundary","text":"本步數值為教學假設；套用到實際設備前，必須重新取得規格、操作條件與不確定度。","textEn":"These numbers are teaching assumptions; before applying them to real equipment, obtain the actual specifications, operating conditions and uncertainties.","sourceIds":["v12o-alma-about","v12o-alma-antennas","v12o-eso-alma","v12o-nrao-alma"]}],"quiz":{"question":"依「流量、頻寬、指向與基線的誤差預算」的定量模型，下列哪一項敘述成立？","questionEn":"According to the quantitative model for \"Flux, bandpass, pointing and baseline error budgets\", which statement holds?","options":["只要天線夠大，站址高度對毫米波觀測影響不大。","指向損失（高斯波束）≈ exp[−4ln2·(δ/θ_PB)²]：δ = 0.6″ 在 345 GHz（θ_PB = 16.9″）時損失僅 0.35%，在 950 GHz（θ_PB ≈ 6.2″）時損失 2.6%。","25 µm 的面形精度對 ALMA 所有波段都綽綽有餘。"],"optionsEn":["With big enough antennas, site altitude hardly matters at millimetre wavelengths.","Pointing loss (Gaussian beam) ≈ exp[−4ln2·(δ/θ_PB)²]: δ = 0.6″ costs only 0.35% at 345 GHz (θ_PB = 16.9″) but 2.6% at 950 GHz (θ_PB ≈ 6.2″).","A 25 µm surface is more than good enough for every ALMA band."],"answer":1,"explanation":"指向損失（高斯波束）≈ exp[−4ln2·(δ/θ_PB)²]：δ = 0.6″ 在 345 GHz（θ_PB = 16.9″）時損失僅 0.35%，在 950 GHz（θ_PB ≈ 6.2″）時損失 2.6%。 重算時請保留單位。","explanationEn":"Pointing loss (Gaussian beam) ≈ exp[−4ln2·(δ/θ_PB)²]: δ = 0.6″ costs only 0.35% at 345 GHz (θ_PB = 16.9″) but 2.6% at 950 GHz (θ_PB ≈ 6.2″). Keep units when recalculating."},"unit":6,"unitFacet":"model","order":6,"sequence":22},{"id":"a494-v12-23","title":"流量、頻寬、指向與基線的誤差預算：量測與驗證","titleEn":"Flux, bandpass, pointing and baseline error budgets: measurement and verification","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-alma-about","v12o-alma-antennas","v12o-eso-alma","v12o-nrao-alma"],"prerequisiteIds":["a494-v12-22"],"objective":"設計一項可重複的量測，驗證「校正鏈與誤差預算表」是否符合模型預期，並訂出允收準則。","objectiveEn":"Design a repeatable measurement that verifies whether “Calibration chain and error-budget table” meets the model expectation, and set acceptance criteria.","instruction":"在同一觀測中交替觀測兩個已知流量的校正源，把其中一個當成「未知目標」做完整校正流程，比較回復流量與目錄值的偏差；同時檢查相位參考後目標相位的殘餘斜率是否隨校正源角距離增長，若是則重解天線位置。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成量測計畫，列出儀器、基準件或參考樣品、步驟、比較對象與允收準則，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。","instructionEn":"Within one observation alternate between two calibrators of known flux, treat one as an unknown target, run the full calibration and compare the recovered flux with the catalogue value; also check whether the residual phase slope on the target after phase referencing grows with calibrator separation, and if so re-solve the antenna positions. Mentor task: turn this into a measurement plan listing instruments, reference artefacts or samples, procedure, comparison baseline and acceptance criteria, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.","observation":"注意干擾：把流量不確定度的各項以線性相加、或在預算表中同時列入 WVR 殘餘與相位參考殘餘而重複計算，會讓文件看起來保守，實際卻掩蓋了主導項；相反地忘記列入天線位置誤差，會讓長基線的相位系統誤差一路傳到科學影像。","observationEn":"Watch for interference: Adding flux-uncertainty terms linearly, or double counting the WVR residual and the phase-referencing residual in the budget, makes the document look conservative while hiding the dominant term; conversely, omitting antenna-position error lets a systematic long-baseline phase error propagate all the way into the science image.","failure":"驗證陷阱：只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄環境條件，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。","failureEn":"Verification traps: a single measurement, no traceable reference, or unrecorded environmental conditions make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.","check":"提交量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格。","checkEn":"Submit the measurement plan: instruments, reference, procedure, acceptance criteria and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail decision rule.","knowledge":[{"id":"a494-v12-23-k1","title":"驗證方法","titleEn":"Verification method","text":"在同一觀測中交替觀測兩個已知流量的校正源，把其中一個當成「未知目標」做完整校正流程，比較回復流量與目錄值的偏差；同時檢查相位參考後目標相位的殘餘斜率是否隨校正源角距離增長，若是則重解天線位置。","textEn":"Within one observation alternate between two calibrators of known flux, treat one as an unknown target, run the full calibration and compare the recovered flux with the catalogue value; also check whether the residual phase slope on the target after phase referencing grows with calibrator separation, and if so re-solve the antenna positions.","sourceIds":["v12o-alma-about","v12o-alma-antennas","v12o-eso-alma","v12o-nrao-alma"]},{"id":"a494-v12-23-k2","title":"允收與不確定度","titleEn":"Acceptance and uncertainty","text":"允收準則必須在量測前訂定，並與擴充不確定度一起陳述；比較基準需可追溯。","textEn":"Acceptance criteria are fixed before measuring and stated together with expanded uncertainty; the comparison reference must be traceable.","sourceIds":["v12o-alma-about","v12o-alma-antennas","v12o-eso-alma","v12o-nrao-alma"]}],"quiz":{"question":"要驗證「流量、頻寬、指向與基線的誤差預算」，下列哪一個做法最恰當？","questionEn":"Which approach best verifies \"Flux, bandpass, pointing and baseline error budgets\"?","options":["只要模擬結果看起來合理，就可以省略實體量測與校正。","接收機冷到 4 K 之後，系統溫度就只剩天空的貢獻。","在同一觀測中交替觀測兩個已知流量的校正源，把其中一個當成「未知目標」做完整校正流程，比較回復流量與目錄值的偏差。"],"optionsEn":["If the simulation looks reasonable, physical measurement and calibration can be skipped.","Once the receiver is at 4 K, the system temperature is only the sky's contribution.","Within one observation alternate between two calibrators of known flux, treat one as an unknown target, run the full calibration and compare the recovered flux with the catalogue value."],"answer":2,"explanation":"在同一觀測中交替觀測兩個已知流量的校正源，把其中一個當成「未知目標」做完整校正流程，比較回復流量與目錄值的偏差；同時檢查相位參考後目標相位的殘餘斜率是否隨校正源角距離增長，若是則重解天線位置。 驗證需要基準、重複性與允收準則。","explanationEn":"Within one observation alternate between two calibrators of known flux, treat one as an unknown target, run the full calibration and compare the recovered flux with the catalogue value; also check whether the residual phase slope on the target after phase referencing grows with calibrator separation, and if so re-solve the antenna positions. Verification needs a reference, repeatability and acceptance criteria."},"unit":6,"unitFacet":"verification","order":7,"sequence":23},{"id":"a494-v12-24","title":"流量、頻寬、指向與基線的誤差預算：失效診斷","titleEn":"Flux, bandpass, pointing and baseline error budgets: failure diagnosis","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-alma-about","v12o-alma-antennas","v12o-eso-alma","v12o-nrao-alma"],"prerequisiteIds":["a494-v12-23"],"objective":"從症狀倒推「校正鏈與誤差預算表」的失效原因，提出能區分原因的檢查與矯正措施。","objectiveEn":"Work back from symptoms to the failure causes of “Calibration chain and error-budget table” and propose discriminating checks and corrective actions.","instruction":"把流量不確定度的各項以線性相加、或在預算表中同時列入 WVR 殘餘與相位參考殘餘而重複計算，會讓文件看起來保守，實際卻掩蓋了主導項；相反地忘記列入天線位置誤差，會讓長基線的相位系統誤差一路傳到科學影像。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整個系統的性能、良率或安全。","instructionEn":"Adding flux-uncertainty terms linearly, or double counting the WVR residual and the phase-referencing residual in the budget, makes the document look conservative while hiding the dominant term; conversely, omitting antenna-position error lets a systematic long-baseline phase error propagate all the way into the science image. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-system performance, yield or safety.","observation":"連結機制：工程師要把這些項目列成誤差預算，量化每一項對振幅與相位的貢獻，才知道影像的流量不確定度（通常 5–10%）由誰主導。","observationEn":"Link to the mechanism: The engineer tabulates these items in an error budget, quantifying each contribution to amplitude and phase, to learn which term dominates the image flux uncertainty, typically 5–10%.","failure":"誤判風險：若相信「流量校正用的行星是理想點源，不需要模型。」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。","failureEn":"Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"Planets used for flux calibration are ideal point sources and need no model.\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.","check":"完成失效樹與矯正措施，並指出哪一項量測能最快確認根因、如何防止再發。","checkEn":"Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement that confirms the root cause fastest, and state how recurrence is prevented.","knowledge":[{"id":"a494-v12-24-k1","title":"失效模式","titleEn":"Failure mode","text":"把流量不確定度的各項以線性相加、或在預算表中同時列入 WVR 殘餘與相位參考殘餘而重複計算，會讓文件看起來保守，實際卻掩蓋了主導項；相反地忘記列入天線位置誤差，會讓長基線的相位系統誤差一路傳到科學影像。","textEn":"Adding flux-uncertainty terms linearly, or double counting the WVR residual and the phase-referencing residual in the budget, makes the document look conservative while hiding the dominant term; conversely, omitting antenna-position error lets a systematic long-baseline phase error propagate all the way into the science image.","sourceIds":["v12o-alma-about","v12o-alma-antennas","v12o-eso-alma","v12o-nrao-alma"]},{"id":"a494-v12-24-k2","title":"根因確認","titleEn":"Root-cause confirmation","text":"根因必須以可區分的量測確認；只更換零件或放寬參數可能掩蓋問題。","textEn":"Confirm the root cause with a discriminating measurement; merely swapping parts or relaxing limits can mask the problem.","sourceIds":["v12o-alma-about","v12o-alma-antennas","v12o-eso-alma","v12o-nrao-alma"]}],"quiz":{"question":"在「流量、頻寬、指向與基線的誤差預算」出現異常時，下列哪一項判斷最合理？","questionEn":"When \"Flux, bandpass, pointing and baseline error budgets\" misbehaves, which diagnosis is most reasonable?","options":["把流量不確定度的各項以線性相加、或在預算表中同時列入 WVR 殘餘與相位參考殘餘而重複計算，會讓文件看起來保守，實際卻掩蓋了主導項。","只要重新開機或重設軟體，硬體失效也會一併排除。","天線數加倍，靈敏度就恰好加倍。"],"optionsEn":["Adding flux-uncertainty terms linearly, or double counting the WVR residual and the phase-referencing residual in the budget, makes the document look conservative while hiding the dominant term.","Restarting or resetting the software also clears hardware failures.","Doubling the number of antennas exactly doubles the sensitivity."],"answer":0,"explanation":"把流量不確定度的各項以線性相加、或在預算表中同時列入 WVR 殘餘與相位參考殘餘而重複計算，會讓文件看起來保守，實際卻掩蓋了主導項；相反地忘記列入天線位置誤差，會讓長基線的相位系統誤差一路傳到科學影像。 需以量測區分可能原因。","explanationEn":"Adding flux-uncertainty terms linearly, or double counting the WVR residual and the phase-referencing residual in the budget, makes the document look conservative while hiding the dominant term; conversely, omitting antenna-position error lets a systematic long-baseline phase error propagate all the way into the science image. Discriminate candidate causes by measurement."},"unit":6,"unitFacet":"failure","order":8,"sequence":24}],"order":3},{"id":"a494-v12-s4","title":"系統整合、驗證與工程交接","titleEn":"Integration, validation and engineering handoff","description":"本階段聚焦「數位化、相關器與靈敏度方程」與「天線整合、重組與陣列驗收」：先建立機制與定量模型，再設計驗證並診斷失效。","descriptionEn":"This stage covers \"Digitisation, the correlator and the sensitivity equation\" and \"Antenna integration, reconfiguration and array acceptance\": build the mechanism and quantitative model first, then design verification and diagnose failures.","steps":[{"id":"a494-v12-25","title":"數位化、相關器與靈敏度方程：原理與系統邊界","titleEn":"Digitisation, the correlator and the sensitivity equation: mechanism and system boundary","estimatedMinutes":20,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-alma-about","v12o-alma-antennas","v12o-eso-alma","v12o-nrao-alma"],"prerequisiteIds":["a494-v12-24"],"objective":"說明「高原相關器與資料傳輸」如何決定ALMA 大型毫米及次毫米波陣列的關鍵性能，並畫出其輸入、輸出與邊界。","objectiveEn":"Explain how “Plateau correlator and data transport” determines the key performance of “Atacama Large Millimeter/submillimeter Array”, and map its inputs, outputs and boundaries.","instruction":"每座天線把 4 個 2 GHz 基頻、兩個極化的中頻以 3 位元、4 GS/s 取樣，約 96 Gb/s 的資料經光纖送到海拔 5000 m 的陣列運作站（AOS）相關器；相關器對每一對天線在每個頻道做乘積累加，產生可見度，再以 ACA 相關器處理緊湊陣列。相關器的運算量隨基線數 N(N−1)/2 與頻道數成長，而陣列靈敏度則隨 √(N(N−1)·Δν·τ) 改善，因此天線數、頻寬與整合時間是同一條方程式的三個旋鈕。 師傅任務：以方塊圖畫出能量或訊號通過「高原相關器與資料傳輸」的路徑，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由環境或製造決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。","instructionEn":"Each antenna samples four 2 GHz basebands in two polarisations at 3 bits and 4 GS/s, and about 96 Gb/s of data travel over fibre to the correlator at the 5000 m Array Operations Site (AOS); the correlator multiplies and accumulates every antenna pair in every channel to produce visibilities, with a separate ACA correlator for the compact array. Correlator load grows with the number of baselines N(N−1)/2 and with channel count, while array sensitivity improves as √(N(N−1)·Δν·τ), so antenna count, bandwidth and integration time are three knobs on the same equation. Mentor task: draw a block diagram of the energy or signal path through “Plateau correlator and data transport”, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by environment or fabrication, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.","observation":"量級提示：基線數為 N(N−1)/2：50 座天線有 1225 條基線，66 座有 2145 條。","observationEn":"Order-of-magnitude cue: Baselines N(N−1)/2: 1225 for 50 antennas, 2145 for 66.","failure":"常見誤解：「天線數加倍，靈敏度就恰好加倍。」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在方塊圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。","failureEn":"Common misconception: \"Doubling the number of antennas exactly doubles the sensitivity.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your block diagram where it breaks down.","check":"方塊圖標明「高原相關器與資料傳輸」的輸入、輸出與邊界；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。","checkEn":"The block diagram shows inputs, outputs and boundaries of “Plateau correlator and data transport”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.","knowledge":[{"id":"a494-v12-25-k1","title":"數位化、相關器與靈敏度方程","titleEn":"Digitisation, the correlator and the sensitivity equation","text":"每座天線把 4 個 2 GHz 基頻、兩個極化的中頻以 3 位元、4 GS/s 取樣，約 96 Gb/s 的資料經光纖送到海拔 5000 m 的陣列運作站（AOS）相關器；相關器對每一對天線在每個頻道做乘積累加，產生可見度，再以 ACA 相關器處理緊湊陣列。相關器的運算量隨基線數 N(N−1)/2 與頻道數成長，而陣列靈敏度則隨 √(N(N−1)·Δν·τ) 改善，因此天線數、頻寬與整合時間是同一條方程式的三個旋鈕。","textEn":"Each antenna samples four 2 GHz basebands in two polarisations at 3 bits and 4 GS/s, and about 96 Gb/s of data travel over fibre to the correlator at the 5000 m Array Operations Site (AOS); the correlator multiplies and accumulates every antenna pair in every channel to produce visibilities, with a separate ACA correlator for the compact array. Correlator load grows with the number of baselines N(N−1)/2 and with channel count, while array sensitivity improves as √(N(N−1)·Δν·τ), so antenna count, bandwidth and integration time are three knobs on the same equation.","sourceIds":["v12o-alma-about","v12o-alma-antennas","v12o-eso-alma","v12o-nrao-alma"]},{"id":"a494-v12-25-k2","title":"誤解辨析","titleEn":"Misconception check","text":"誤解：天線數加倍，靈敏度就恰好加倍。 正確的工程判斷必須回到機制與量級。","textEn":"Misconception: Doubling the number of antennas exactly doubles the sensitivity. Sound engineering judgement goes back to mechanism and magnitude.","sourceIds":["v12o-alma-about","v12o-alma-antennas","v12o-eso-alma","v12o-nrao-alma"]}],"quiz":{"question":"關於「數位化、相關器與靈敏度方程」，下列哪一項敘述正確？","questionEn":"Which statement about \"Digitisation, the correlator and the sensitivity equation\" is correct?","options":["天線數加倍，靈敏度就恰好加倍。","每座天線把 4 個 2 GHz 基頻、兩個極化的中頻以 3 位元、4 GS/s 取樣，約 96 Gb/s 的資料經光纖送到海拔 5000 m 的陣列運作站（AOS）相關器。","每座天線各自通過驗收，陣列就自動可以做科學觀測。"],"optionsEn":["Doubling the number of antennas exactly doubles the sensitivity.","Each antenna samples four 2 GHz basebands in two polarisations at 3 bits and 4 GS/s, and about 96 Gb/s of data travel over fibre to the correlator at the 5000 m Array Operations Site (AOS).","If every antenna passes its own acceptance, the array is automatically ready for science."],"answer":1,"explanation":"每座天線把 4 個 2 GHz 基頻、兩個極化的中頻以 3 位元、4 GS/s 取樣，約 96 Gb/s 的資料經光纖送到海拔 5000 m 的陣列運作站（AOS）相關器；相關器對每一對天線在每個頻道做乘積累加，產生可見度，再以 ACA 相關器處理緊湊陣列。 其餘選項是常見誤解。","explanationEn":"Each antenna samples four 2 GHz basebands in two polarisations at 3 bits and 4 GS/s, and about 96 Gb/s of data travel over fibre to the correlator at the 5000 m Array Operations Site (AOS); the correlator multiplies and accumulates every antenna pair in every channel to produce visibilities, with a separate ACA correlator for the compact array. The other options are common misconceptions."},"unit":7,"unitFacet":"mechanism","order":1,"sequence":25},{"id":"a494-v12-26","title":"數位化、相關器與靈敏度方程：定量估算","titleEn":"Digitisation, the correlator and the sensitivity equation: quantitative estimate","estimatedMinutes":30,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-alma-about","v12o-alma-antennas","v12o-eso-alma","v12o-nrao-alma"],"prerequisiteIds":["a494-v12-25"],"objective":"以數值模型估算「高原相關器與資料傳輸」的關鍵量，並判斷參數改變時結果的方向與幅度。","objectiveEn":"Estimate the key quantities of “Plateau correlator and data transport” with a numerical model and judge the direction and size of changes when a parameter moves.","instruction":"依下列模型逐步重算：基線數為 N(N−1)/2：50 座天線有 1225 條基線，66 座有 2145 條。點源靈敏度（熱雜訊）ΔS ≈ 2k·T_sys/[η_c·η_a·A·√(N(N−1)·n_p·Δν·τ)]，其中 η_c 為相關器量化效率、η_a 為口徑效率、n_p 為極化數。取系統溫度 T_sys = 123 K、η_c = 0.88、η_a = 0.70、單天線面積 A = 113 m²（12 m）、N = 50、n_p = 2、頻寬 Δν = 7.5 GHz、整合時間 τ = 60 s：分母為 69.7×√(2.2×10¹⁵) = 69.7×4.7×10⁷ = 3.27×10⁹，得 ΔS ≈ 3.40×10⁻²¹/3.27×10⁹ ≈ 1.0×10⁻³⁰ W m⁻² Hz⁻¹ ≈ 0.10 mJy。 師傅任務：保留單位重算一次，再只改變一個輸入（例如增加 10%），預測並計算輸出的變化，說明它是線性、平方或更高次方的關係。","instructionEn":"Recalculate step by step: Baselines N(N−1)/2: 1225 for 50 antennas, 2145 for 66. Point-source sensitivity ΔS ≈ 2k·T_sys/[η_c·η_a·A·√(N(N−1)·n_p·Δν·τ)]. With T_sys = 123 K, η_c = 0.88, η_a = 0.70, A = 113 m² (12 m), N = 50, n_p = 2, Δν = 7.5 GHz and τ = 60 s: the denominator is 69.7×√(2.2×10¹⁵) = 69.7×4.7×10⁷ = 3.27×10⁹, so ΔS ≈ 3.40×10⁻²¹/3.27×10⁹ ≈ 1.0×10⁻³⁰ W m⁻² Hz⁻¹ ≈ 0.10 mJy. Mentor task: redo the calculation keeping units, then change one input (for example by +10%), predict and compute the output change, and state whether the dependence is linear, quadratic or steeper.","observation":"如何核對：把一段無源的空天區資料成像，量測影像的 RMS 雜訊並與靈敏度方程的預測比較，差異應在 20% 內；再檢查相關器輸出的量化修正（3 位元取樣的 η_c）與資料傳輸的遺失封包率，確認雜訊不是來自資料鏈而是熱雜訊。","observationEn":"How to cross-check: Image an empty region of sky, measure the image RMS noise and compare it with the sensitivity-equation prediction, expecting agreement within 20%; then check the quantisation correction applied to the correlator output (η_c for 3-bit sampling) and the packet-loss rate of the data link to confirm that the noise is thermal and not from the data chain.","failure":"計算陷阱：單位換算錯誤、把教學假設當成設備規格，或只看結果不檢查數量級，都會讓後續設計判斷失準。","failureEn":"Calculation traps: unit conversion slips, treating teaching assumptions as equipment specifications, or accepting a result without checking its magnitude will mislead later design decisions.","check":"重現模型中的數值（取整誤差在 ±5% 內），並提交一個參數改變後的敏感度計算與物理解釋。","checkEn":"Reproduce the model values (within ±5% rounding) and submit a sensitivity calculation for one changed parameter with a physical explanation.","knowledge":[{"id":"a494-v12-26-k1","title":"定量模型","titleEn":"Quantitative model","text":"基線數為 N(N−1)/2：50 座天線有 1225 條基線，66 座有 2145 條。點源靈敏度（熱雜訊）ΔS ≈ 2k·T_sys/[η_c·η_a·A·√(N(N−1)·n_p·Δν·τ)]，其中 η_c 為相關器量化效率、η_a 為口徑效率、n_p 為極化數。取系統溫度 T_sys = 123 K、η_c = 0.88、η_a = 0.70、單天線面積 A = 113 m²（12 m）、N = 50、n_p = 2、頻寬 Δν = 7.5 GHz、整合時間 τ = 60 s：分母為 69.7×√(2.2×10¹⁵) = 69.7×4.7×10⁷ = 3.27×10⁹，得 ΔS ≈ 3.40×10⁻²¹/3.27×10⁹ ≈ 1.0×10⁻³⁰ W m⁻² Hz⁻¹ ≈ 0.10 mJy。","textEn":"Baselines N(N−1)/2: 1225 for 50 antennas, 2145 for 66. Point-source sensitivity ΔS ≈ 2k·T_sys/[η_c·η_a·A·√(N(N−1)·n_p·Δν·τ)]. With T_sys = 123 K, η_c = 0.88, η_a = 0.70, A = 113 m² (12 m), N = 50, n_p = 2, Δν = 7.5 GHz and τ = 60 s: the denominator is 69.7×√(2.2×10¹⁵) = 69.7×4.7×10⁷ = 3.27×10⁹, so ΔS ≈ 3.40×10⁻²¹/3.27×10⁹ ≈ 1.0×10⁻³⁰ W m⁻² Hz⁻¹ ≈ 0.10 mJy.","sourceIds":["v12o-alma-about","v12o-alma-antennas","v12o-eso-alma","v12o-nrao-alma"]},{"id":"a494-v12-26-k2","title":"模型邊界","titleEn":"Model boundary","text":"本步數值為教學假設；套用到實際設備前，必須重新取得規格、操作條件與不確定度。","textEn":"These numbers are teaching assumptions; before applying them to real equipment, obtain the actual specifications, operating conditions and uncertainties.","sourceIds":["v12o-alma-about","v12o-alma-antennas","v12o-eso-alma","v12o-nrao-alma"]}],"quiz":{"question":"依「數位化、相關器與靈敏度方程」的定量模型，下列哪一項敘述成立？","questionEn":"According to the quantitative model for \"Digitisation, the correlator and the sensitivity equation\", which statement holds?","options":["基線越長影像品質一定越好，短基線只是備用。","接收機冷到 4 K 之後，系統溫度就只剩天空的貢獻。","基線數為 N(N−1)/2：50 座天線有 1225 條基線，66 座有 2145 條。"],"optionsEn":["Longer baselines always give better images; short baselines are just backup.","Once the receiver is at 4 K, the system temperature is only the sky's contribution.","Baselines N(N−1)/2: 1225 for 50 antennas, 2145 for 66."],"answer":2,"explanation":"基線數為 N(N−1)/2：50 座天線有 1225 條基線，66 座有 2145 條。 重算時請保留單位。","explanationEn":"Baselines N(N−1)/2: 1225 for 50 antennas, 2145 for 66. Keep units when recalculating."},"unit":7,"unitFacet":"model","order":2,"sequence":26},{"id":"a494-v12-27","title":"數位化、相關器與靈敏度方程：量測與驗證","titleEn":"Digitisation, the correlator and the sensitivity equation: measurement and verification","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-alma-about","v12o-alma-antennas","v12o-eso-alma","v12o-nrao-alma"],"prerequisiteIds":["a494-v12-26"],"objective":"設計一項可重複的量測，驗證「高原相關器與資料傳輸」是否符合模型預期，並訂出允收準則。","objectiveEn":"Design a repeatable measurement that verifies whether “Plateau correlator and data transport” meets the model expectation, and set acceptance criteria.","instruction":"把一段無源的空天區資料成像，量測影像的 RMS 雜訊並與靈敏度方程的預測比較，差異應在 20% 內；再檢查相關器輸出的量化修正（3 位元取樣的 η_c）與資料傳輸的遺失封包率，確認雜訊不是來自資料鏈而是熱雜訊。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成量測計畫，列出儀器、基準件或參考樣品、步驟、比較對象與允收準則，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。","instructionEn":"Image an empty region of sky, measure the image RMS noise and compare it with the sensitivity-equation prediction, expecting agreement within 20%; then check the quantisation correction applied to the correlator output (η_c for 3-bit sampling) and the packet-loss rate of the data link to confirm that the noise is thermal and not from the data chain. Mentor task: turn this into a measurement plan listing instruments, reference artefacts or samples, procedure, comparison baseline and acceptance criteria, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.","observation":"注意干擾：數位化器的取樣電平未隨 IF 功率調整時，3 位元量化落到非線性區，η_c 從 0.88 掉到 0.7 以下，而且強源附近出現假訊號；靈敏度預測與實測差距擴大卻找不到天氣或接收機原因。","observationEn":"Watch for interference: If digitiser sampling thresholds are not adjusted to the IF power, 3-bit quantisation falls into its nonlinear range, η_c drops from 0.88 to below 0.7 and spurious signals appear near strong sources; the gap between predicted and measured sensitivity widens with no weather or receiver cause to blame.","failure":"驗證陷阱：只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄環境條件，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。","failureEn":"Verification traps: a single measurement, no traceable reference, or unrecorded environmental conditions make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.","check":"提交量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格。","checkEn":"Submit the measurement plan: instruments, reference, procedure, acceptance criteria and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail decision rule.","knowledge":[{"id":"a494-v12-27-k1","title":"驗證方法","titleEn":"Verification method","text":"把一段無源的空天區資料成像，量測影像的 RMS 雜訊並與靈敏度方程的預測比較，差異應在 20% 內；再檢查相關器輸出的量化修正（3 位元取樣的 η_c）與資料傳輸的遺失封包率，確認雜訊不是來自資料鏈而是熱雜訊。","textEn":"Image an empty region of sky, measure the image RMS noise and compare it with the sensitivity-equation prediction, expecting agreement within 20%; then check the quantisation correction applied to the correlator output (η_c for 3-bit sampling) and the packet-loss rate of the data link to confirm that the noise is thermal and not from the data chain.","sourceIds":["v12o-alma-about","v12o-alma-antennas","v12o-eso-alma","v12o-nrao-alma"]},{"id":"a494-v12-27-k2","title":"允收與不確定度","titleEn":"Acceptance and uncertainty","text":"允收準則必須在量測前訂定，並與擴充不確定度一起陳述；比較基準需可追溯。","textEn":"Acceptance criteria are fixed before measuring and stated together with expanded uncertainty; the comparison reference must be traceable.","sourceIds":["v12o-alma-about","v12o-alma-antennas","v12o-eso-alma","v12o-nrao-alma"]}],"quiz":{"question":"要驗證「數位化、相關器與靈敏度方程」，下列哪一個做法最恰當？","questionEn":"Which approach best verifies \"Digitisation, the correlator and the sensitivity equation\"?","options":["把一段無源的空天區資料成像，量測影像的 RMS 雜訊並與靈敏度方程的預測比較，差異應在 20% 內。","量測時不必記錄溫度、振動與時間等條件，因為它們不會影響結果。","乾燥站址上的大氣相位是穩定的，只要校正一次即可。"],"optionsEn":["Image an empty region of sky, measure the image RMS noise and compare it with the sensitivity-equation prediction, expecting agreement within 20%.","Temperature, vibration and timing need not be recorded because they cannot affect the result.","At a dry site the atmospheric phase is stable, so one calibration is enough."],"answer":0,"explanation":"把一段無源的空天區資料成像，量測影像的 RMS 雜訊並與靈敏度方程的預測比較，差異應在 20% 內；再檢查相關器輸出的量化修正（3 位元取樣的 η_c）與資料傳輸的遺失封包率，確認雜訊不是來自資料鏈而是熱雜訊。 驗證需要基準、重複性與允收準則。","explanationEn":"Image an empty region of sky, measure the image RMS noise and compare it with the sensitivity-equation prediction, expecting agreement within 20%; then check the quantisation correction applied to the correlator output (η_c for 3-bit sampling) and the packet-loss rate of the data link to confirm that the noise is thermal and not from the data chain. Verification needs a reference, repeatability and acceptance criteria."},"unit":7,"unitFacet":"verification","order":3,"sequence":27},{"id":"a494-v12-28","title":"數位化、相關器與靈敏度方程：失效診斷","titleEn":"Digitisation, the correlator and the sensitivity equation: failure diagnosis","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-alma-about","v12o-alma-antennas","v12o-eso-alma","v12o-nrao-alma"],"prerequisiteIds":["a494-v12-27"],"objective":"從症狀倒推「高原相關器與資料傳輸」的失效原因，提出能區分原因的檢查與矯正措施。","objectiveEn":"Work back from symptoms to the failure causes of “Plateau correlator and data transport” and propose discriminating checks and corrective actions.","instruction":"數位化器的取樣電平未隨 IF 功率調整時，3 位元量化落到非線性區，η_c 從 0.88 掉到 0.7 以下，而且強源附近出現假訊號；靈敏度預測與實測差距擴大卻找不到天氣或接收機原因。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整個系統的性能、良率或安全。","instructionEn":"If digitiser sampling thresholds are not adjusted to the IF power, 3-bit quantisation falls into its nonlinear range, η_c drops from 0.88 to below 0.7 and spurious signals appear near strong sources; the gap between predicted and measured sensitivity widens with no weather or receiver cause to blame. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-system performance, yield or safety.","observation":"連結機制：相關器的運算量隨基線數 N(N−1)/2 與頻道數成長，而陣列靈敏度則隨 √(N(N−1)·Δν·τ) 改善，因此天線數、頻寬與整合時間是同一條方程式的三個旋鈕。","observationEn":"Link to the mechanism: Correlator load grows with the number of baselines N(N−1)/2 and with channel count, while array sensitivity improves as √(N(N−1)·Δν·τ), so antenna count, bandwidth and integration time are three knobs on the same equation.","failure":"誤判風險：若相信「天線數加倍，靈敏度就恰好加倍。」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。","failureEn":"Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"Doubling the number of antennas exactly doubles the sensitivity.\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.","check":"完成失效樹與矯正措施，並指出哪一項量測能最快確認根因、如何防止再發。","checkEn":"Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement that confirms the root cause fastest, and state how recurrence is prevented.","knowledge":[{"id":"a494-v12-28-k1","title":"失效模式","titleEn":"Failure mode","text":"數位化器的取樣電平未隨 IF 功率調整時，3 位元量化落到非線性區，η_c 從 0.88 掉到 0.7 以下，而且強源附近出現假訊號；靈敏度預測與實測差距擴大卻找不到天氣或接收機原因。","textEn":"If digitiser sampling thresholds are not adjusted to the IF power, 3-bit quantisation falls into its nonlinear range, η_c drops from 0.88 to below 0.7 and spurious signals appear near strong sources; the gap between predicted and measured sensitivity widens with no weather or receiver cause to blame.","sourceIds":["v12o-alma-about","v12o-alma-antennas","v12o-eso-alma","v12o-nrao-alma"]},{"id":"a494-v12-28-k2","title":"根因確認","titleEn":"Root-cause confirmation","text":"根因必須以可區分的量測確認；只更換零件或放寬參數可能掩蓋問題。","textEn":"Confirm the root cause with a discriminating measurement; merely swapping parts or relaxing limits can mask the problem.","sourceIds":["v12o-alma-about","v12o-alma-antennas","v12o-eso-alma","v12o-nrao-alma"]}],"quiz":{"question":"在「數位化、相關器與靈敏度方程」出現異常時，下列哪一項判斷最合理？","questionEn":"When \"Digitisation, the correlator and the sensitivity equation\" misbehaves, which diagnosis is most reasonable?","options":["所有異常都來自操作人員失誤，系統設計不需要檢討。","數位化器的取樣電平未隨 IF 功率調整時，3 位元量化落到非線性區，η_c 從 0.88 掉到 0.7 以下，而且強源附近出現假訊號。","每座天線各自通過驗收，陣列就自動可以做科學觀測。"],"optionsEn":["Every anomaly is operator error, so the system design never needs review.","If digitiser sampling thresholds are not adjusted to the IF power, 3-bit quantisation falls into its nonlinear range, η_c drops from 0.88 to below 0.7 and spurious signals appear near strong sources.","If every antenna passes its own acceptance, the array is automatically ready for science."],"answer":1,"explanation":"數位化器的取樣電平未隨 IF 功率調整時，3 位元量化落到非線性區，η_c 從 0.88 掉到 0.7 以下，而且強源附近出現假訊號；靈敏度預測與實測差距擴大卻找不到天氣或接收機原因。 需以量測區分可能原因。","explanationEn":"If digitiser sampling thresholds are not adjusted to the IF power, 3-bit quantisation falls into its nonlinear range, η_c drops from 0.88 to below 0.7 and spurious signals appear near strong sources; the gap between predicted and measured sensitivity widens with no weather or receiver cause to blame. Discriminate candidate causes by measurement."},"unit":7,"unitFacet":"failure","order":4,"sequence":28},{"id":"a494-v12-29","title":"天線整合、重組與陣列驗收：原理與系統邊界","titleEn":"Antenna integration, reconfiguration and array acceptance: mechanism and system boundary","estimatedMinutes":20,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-alma-about","v12o-alma-antennas","v12o-eso-alma","v12o-nrao-alma"],"prerequisiteIds":["a494-v12-28"],"objective":"說明「陣列重組與系統驗收紀錄」如何決定ALMA 大型毫米及次毫米波陣列的關鍵性能，並畫出其輸入、輸出與邊界。","objectiveEn":"Explain how “Array reconfiguration and system-acceptance record” determines the key performance of “Atacama Large Millimeter/submillimeter Array”, and map its inputs, outputs and boundaries.","instruction":"天線先在 OSF 組裝並完成全像、指向與伺服測試，再由 28 輪的運輸車載上 5000 m 高原的 192 個基座之一；每次重組後要重解天線位置、確認光纖長度補償（線長校正器）與 LO 鎖相，並以閉合相位檢驗相關器與資料鏈。陣列的驗收不是逐天線合格，而是以整體指標判定：相位穩定度對基線長度的關係、影像動態範圍、流量尺度一致性與可觀測時間比例，這些數字進入系統驗證紀錄並成為每個觀測週期的基準。 師傅任務：以方塊圖畫出能量或訊號通過「陣列重組與系統驗收紀錄」的路徑，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由環境或製造決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。","instructionEn":"An antenna is first assembled at the OSF, passing holography, pointing and servo tests, then carried by a 28-wheel transporter to one of 192 pads on the 5000 m plateau; after each reconfiguration the antenna positions are re-solved, the fibre length compensation (line-length corrector) and LO phase lock are confirmed, and closure phases check the correlator and data chain. The array is accepted not antenna by antenna but on system metrics: phase stability versus baseline length, image dynamic range, flux-scale consistency and the fraction of usable observing time, all recorded in the system-verification record that becomes the baseline for each observing cycle. Mentor task: draw a block diagram of the energy or signal path through “Array reconfiguration and system-acceptance record”, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by environment or fabrication, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.","observation":"量級提示：快照影像動態範圍的粗估 D ≈ √(N_bl·N_t)/σ_φ：N_bl = 1225、N_t = 100 個時間取樣、殘餘天線相位 σ_φ = 5°（0.087 rad）時 D ≈ 350/0.087 ≈ 4000:1；若 σ_φ = 20°（0.35 rad）則 D ≈ 1000:1。","observationEn":"Order-of-magnitude cue: A rough snapshot dynamic range is D ≈ √(N_bl·N_t)/σ_φ: with N_bl = 1225, N_t = 100 time samples and a residual antenna phase σ_φ = 5° (0.087 rad), D ≈ 350/0.087 ≈ 4000:1; with σ_φ = 20° (0.35 rad), D ≈ 1000:1.","failure":"常見誤解：「每座天線各自通過驗收，陣列就自動可以做科學觀測。」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在方塊圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。","failureEn":"Common misconception: \"If every antenna passes its own acceptance, the array is automatically ready for science.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your block diagram where it breaks down.","check":"方塊圖標明「陣列重組與系統驗收紀錄」的輸入、輸出與邊界；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。","checkEn":"The block diagram shows inputs, outputs and boundaries of “Array reconfiguration and system-acceptance record”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.","knowledge":[{"id":"a494-v12-29-k1","title":"天線整合、重組與陣列驗收","titleEn":"Antenna integration, reconfiguration and array acceptance","text":"天線先在 OSF 組裝並完成全像、指向與伺服測試，再由 28 輪的運輸車載上 5000 m 高原的 192 個基座之一；每次重組後要重解天線位置、確認光纖長度補償（線長校正器）與 LO 鎖相，並以閉合相位檢驗相關器與資料鏈。陣列的驗收不是逐天線合格，而是以整體指標判定：相位穩定度對基線長度的關係、影像動態範圍、流量尺度一致性與可觀測時間比例，這些數字進入系統驗證紀錄並成為每個觀測週期的基準。","textEn":"An antenna is first assembled at the OSF, passing holography, pointing and servo tests, then carried by a 28-wheel transporter to one of 192 pads on the 5000 m plateau; after each reconfiguration the antenna positions are re-solved, the fibre length compensation (line-length corrector) and LO phase lock are confirmed, and closure phases check the correlator and data chain. The array is accepted not antenna by antenna but on system metrics: phase stability versus baseline length, image dynamic range, flux-scale consistency and the fraction of usable observing time, all recorded in the system-verification record that becomes the baseline for each observing cycle.","sourceIds":["v12o-alma-about","v12o-alma-antennas","v12o-eso-alma","v12o-nrao-alma"]},{"id":"a494-v12-29-k2","title":"誤解辨析","titleEn":"Misconception check","text":"誤解：每座天線各自通過驗收，陣列就自動可以做科學觀測。 正確的工程判斷必須回到機制與量級。","textEn":"Misconception: If every antenna passes its own acceptance, the array is automatically ready for science. Sound engineering judgement goes back to mechanism and magnitude.","sourceIds":["v12o-alma-about","v12o-alma-antennas","v12o-eso-alma","v12o-nrao-alma"]}],"quiz":{"question":"關於「天線整合、重組與陣列驗收」，下列哪一項敘述正確？","questionEn":"Which statement about \"Antenna integration, reconfiguration and array acceptance\" is correct?","options":["每座天線各自通過驗收，陣列就自動可以做科學觀測。","只要天線夠大，站址高度對毫米波觀測影響不大。","天線先在 OSF 組裝並完成全像、指向與伺服測試，再由 28 輪的運輸車載上 5000 m 高原的 192 個基座之一。"],"optionsEn":["If every antenna passes its own acceptance, the array is automatically ready for science.","With big enough antennas, site altitude hardly matters at millimetre wavelengths.","An antenna is first assembled at the OSF, passing holography, pointing and servo tests, then carried by a 28-wheel transporter to one of 192 pads on the 5000 m plateau."],"answer":2,"explanation":"天線先在 OSF 組裝並完成全像、指向與伺服測試，再由 28 輪的運輸車載上 5000 m 高原的 192 個基座之一；每次重組後要重解天線位置、確認光纖長度補償（線長校正器）與 LO 鎖相，並以閉合相位檢驗相關器與資料鏈。 其餘選項是常見誤解。","explanationEn":"An antenna is first assembled at the OSF, passing holography, pointing and servo tests, then carried by a 28-wheel transporter to one of 192 pads on the 5000 m plateau; after each reconfiguration the antenna positions are re-solved, the fibre length compensation (line-length corrector) and LO phase lock are confirmed, and closure phases check the correlator and data chain. The other options are common misconceptions."},"unit":8,"unitFacet":"mechanism","order":5,"sequence":29},{"id":"a494-v12-30","title":"天線整合、重組與陣列驗收：定量估算","titleEn":"Antenna integration, reconfiguration and array acceptance: quantitative estimate","estimatedMinutes":30,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-alma-about","v12o-alma-antennas","v12o-eso-alma","v12o-nrao-alma"],"prerequisiteIds":["a494-v12-29"],"objective":"以數值模型估算「陣列重組與系統驗收紀錄」的關鍵量，並判斷參數改變時結果的方向與幅度。","objectiveEn":"Estimate the key quantities of “Array reconfiguration and system-acceptance record” with a numerical model and judge the direction and size of changes when a parameter moves.","instruction":"依下列模型逐步重算：快照影像動態範圍的粗估 D ≈ √(N_bl·N_t)/σ_φ：N_bl = 1225、N_t = 100 個時間取樣、殘餘天線相位 σ_φ = 5°（0.087 rad）時 D ≈ 350/0.087 ≈ 4000:1；若 σ_φ = 20°（0.35 rad）則 D ≈ 1000:1。三天線閉合相位 φ₁₂ + φ₂₃ + φ₃₁ 與天線相位誤差無關，應在雜訊內為 0。 師傅任務：保留單位重算一次，再只改變一個輸入（例如增加 10%），預測並計算輸出的變化，說明它是線性、平方或更高次方的關係。","instructionEn":"Recalculate step by step: A rough snapshot dynamic range is D ≈ √(N_bl·N_t)/σ_φ: with N_bl = 1225, N_t = 100 time samples and a residual antenna phase σ_φ = 5° (0.087 rad), D ≈ 350/0.087 ≈ 4000:1; with σ_φ = 20° (0.35 rad), D ≈ 1000:1. The three-antenna closure phase φ₁₂ + φ₂₃ + φ₃₁ is independent of antenna-based errors and should be zero within noise. Mentor task: redo the calculation keeping units, then change one input (for example by +10%), predict and compute the output change, and state whether the dependence is linear, quadratic or steeper.","observation":"如何核對：重組後先對強類星體做短觀測：檢查所有三角形的閉合相位是否為零、各天線的相位解是否連續，再對同一源自校正（self-calibration）量影像動態範圍；把相位 RMS 對基線的曲線、動態範圍與流量尺度寫入驗收紀錄，與前一次配置比較，差異超過預期者回頭查天線位置或線長補償。","observationEn":"How to cross-check: After a reconfiguration make a short observation of a strong quasar: check that closure phases on all triangles are zero, that each antenna's phase solution is continuous, then self-calibrate the same source and measure image dynamic range; enter the phase-RMS-versus-baseline curve, dynamic range and flux scale into the acceptance record, compare with the previous configuration, and trace any excess to antenna positions or line-length compensation.","failure":"計算陷阱：單位換算錯誤、把教學假設當成設備規格，或只看結果不檢查數量級，都會讓後續設計判斷失準。","failureEn":"Calculation traps: unit conversion slips, treating teaching assumptions as equipment specifications, or accepting a result without checking its magnitude will mislead later design decisions.","check":"重現模型中的數值（取整誤差在 ±5% 內），並提交一個參數改變後的敏感度計算與物理解釋。","checkEn":"Reproduce the model values (within ±5% rounding) and submit a sensitivity calculation for one changed parameter with a physical explanation.","knowledge":[{"id":"a494-v12-30-k1","title":"定量模型","titleEn":"Quantitative model","text":"快照影像動態範圍的粗估 D ≈ √(N_bl·N_t)/σ_φ：N_bl = 1225、N_t = 100 個時間取樣、殘餘天線相位 σ_φ = 5°（0.087 rad）時 D ≈ 350/0.087 ≈ 4000:1；若 σ_φ = 20°（0.35 rad）則 D ≈ 1000:1。三天線閉合相位 φ₁₂ + φ₂₃ + φ₃₁ 與天線相位誤差無關，應在雜訊內為 0。","textEn":"A rough snapshot dynamic range is D ≈ √(N_bl·N_t)/σ_φ: with N_bl = 1225, N_t = 100 time samples and a residual antenna phase σ_φ = 5° (0.087 rad), D ≈ 350/0.087 ≈ 4000:1; with σ_φ = 20° (0.35 rad), D ≈ 1000:1. The three-antenna closure phase φ₁₂ + φ₂₃ + φ₃₁ is independent of antenna-based errors and should be zero within noise.","sourceIds":["v12o-alma-about","v12o-alma-antennas","v12o-eso-alma","v12o-nrao-alma"]},{"id":"a494-v12-30-k2","title":"模型邊界","titleEn":"Model boundary","text":"本步數值為教學假設；套用到實際設備前，必須重新取得規格、操作條件與不確定度。","textEn":"These numbers are teaching assumptions; before applying them to real equipment, obtain the actual specifications, operating conditions and uncertainties.","sourceIds":["v12o-alma-about","v12o-alma-antennas","v12o-eso-alma","v12o-nrao-alma"]}],"quiz":{"question":"依「天線整合、重組與陣列驗收」的定量模型，下列哪一項敘述成立？","questionEn":"According to the quantitative model for \"Antenna integration, reconfiguration and array acceptance\", which statement holds?","options":["快照影像動態範圍的粗估 D ≈ √(N_bl·N_t)/σ_φ：N_bl = 1225、N_t = 100 個時間取樣、殘餘天線相位 σ_φ = 5°（0.087 rad）時 D ≈ 350/0.087 ≈ 4000:1。","25 µm 的面形精度對 ALMA 所有波段都綽綽有餘。","乾燥站址上的大氣相位是穩定的，只要校正一次即可。"],"optionsEn":["A rough snapshot dynamic range is D ≈ √(N_bl·N_t)/σ_φ: with N_bl = 1225, N_t = 100 time samples and a residual antenna phase σ_φ = 5° (0.087 rad), D ≈ 350/0.087 ≈ 4000:1.","A 25 µm surface is more than good enough for every ALMA band.","At a dry site the atmospheric phase is stable, so one calibration is enough."],"answer":0,"explanation":"快照影像動態範圍的粗估 D ≈ √(N_bl·N_t)/σ_φ：N_bl = 1225、N_t = 100 個時間取樣、殘餘天線相位 σ_φ = 5°（0.087 rad）時 D ≈ 350/0.087 ≈ 4000:1；若 σ_φ = 20°（0.35 rad）則 D ≈ 1000:1。 重算時請保留單位。","explanationEn":"A rough snapshot dynamic range is D ≈ √(N_bl·N_t)/σ_φ: with N_bl = 1225, N_t = 100 time samples and a residual antenna phase σ_φ = 5° (0.087 rad), D ≈ 350/0.087 ≈ 4000:1; with σ_φ = 20° (0.35 rad), D ≈ 1000:1. Keep units when recalculating."},"unit":8,"unitFacet":"model","order":6,"sequence":30},{"id":"a494-v12-31","title":"天線整合、重組與陣列驗收：量測與驗證","titleEn":"Antenna integration, reconfiguration and array acceptance: measurement and verification","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-alma-about","v12o-alma-antennas","v12o-eso-alma","v12o-nrao-alma"],"prerequisiteIds":["a494-v12-30"],"objective":"設計一項可重複的量測，驗證「陣列重組與系統驗收紀錄」是否符合模型預期，並訂出允收準則。","objectiveEn":"Design a repeatable measurement that verifies whether “Array reconfiguration and system-acceptance record” meets the model expectation, and set acceptance criteria.","instruction":"重組後先對強類星體做短觀測：檢查所有三角形的閉合相位是否為零、各天線的相位解是否連續，再對同一源自校正（self-calibration）量影像動態範圍；把相位 RMS 對基線的曲線、動態範圍與流量尺度寫入驗收紀錄，與前一次配置比較，差異超過預期者回頭查天線位置或線長補償。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成量測計畫，列出儀器、基準件或參考樣品、步驟、比較對象與允收準則，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。","instructionEn":"After a reconfiguration make a short observation of a strong quasar: check that closure phases on all triangles are zero, that each antenna's phase solution is continuous, then self-calibrate the same source and measure image dynamic range; enter the phase-RMS-versus-baseline curve, dynamic range and flux scale into the acceptance record, compare with the previous configuration, and trace any excess to antenna positions or line-length compensation. Mentor task: turn this into a measurement plan listing instruments, reference artefacts or samples, procedure, comparison baseline and acceptance criteria, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.","observation":"注意干擾：一座天線在搬移後位置誤差 1 mm 未被重解，所有含該天線的基線相位隨時間緩慢旋轉；自校正會把誤差吸收進增益解而掩蓋問題，但目標源的位置會系統性偏移，直到有人比對校正源位置才發現。","observationEn":"Watch for interference: An antenna whose position is off by 1 mm after a move and not re-solved makes every baseline containing it rotate slowly in phase; self-calibration absorbs the error into gain solutions and hides the problem, but target positions shift systematically until someone compares calibrator positions.","failure":"驗證陷阱：只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄環境條件，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。","failureEn":"Verification traps: a single measurement, no traceable reference, or unrecorded environmental conditions make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.","check":"提交量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格。","checkEn":"Submit the measurement plan: instruments, reference, procedure, acceptance criteria and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail decision rule.","knowledge":[{"id":"a494-v12-31-k1","title":"驗證方法","titleEn":"Verification method","text":"重組後先對強類星體做短觀測：檢查所有三角形的閉合相位是否為零、各天線的相位解是否連續，再對同一源自校正（self-calibration）量影像動態範圍；把相位 RMS 對基線的曲線、動態範圍與流量尺度寫入驗收紀錄，與前一次配置比較，差異超過預期者回頭查天線位置或線長補償。","textEn":"After a reconfiguration make a short observation of a strong quasar: check that closure phases on all triangles are zero, that each antenna's phase solution is continuous, then self-calibrate the same source and measure image dynamic range; enter the phase-RMS-versus-baseline curve, dynamic range and flux scale into the acceptance record, compare with the previous configuration, and trace any excess to antenna positions or line-length compensation.","sourceIds":["v12o-alma-about","v12o-alma-antennas","v12o-eso-alma","v12o-nrao-alma"]},{"id":"a494-v12-31-k2","title":"允收與不確定度","titleEn":"Acceptance and uncertainty","text":"允收準則必須在量測前訂定，並與擴充不確定度一起陳述；比較基準需可追溯。","textEn":"Acceptance criteria are fixed before measuring and stated together with expanded uncertainty; the comparison reference must be traceable.","sourceIds":["v12o-alma-about","v12o-alma-antennas","v12o-eso-alma","v12o-nrao-alma"]}],"quiz":{"question":"要驗證「天線整合、重組與陣列驗收」，下列哪一個做法最恰當？","questionEn":"Which approach best verifies \"Antenna integration, reconfiguration and array acceptance\"?","options":["沿用另一台設備或另一個案例的量測結果，就可視為本系統已完成驗證。","重組後先對強類星體做短觀測：檢查所有三角形的閉合相位是否為零、各天線的相位解是否連續，再對同一源自校正（self-calibration）量影像動態範圍。","流量校正用的行星是理想點源，不需要模型。"],"optionsEn":["Reusing results from another instrument or another case counts as verifying this system.","After a reconfiguration make a short observation of a strong quasar: check that closure phases on all triangles are zero, that each antenna's phase solution is continuous, then self-calibrate the same source and measure image dynamic range.","Planets used for flux calibration are ideal point sources and need no model."],"answer":1,"explanation":"重組後先對強類星體做短觀測：檢查所有三角形的閉合相位是否為零、各天線的相位解是否連續，再對同一源自校正（self-calibration）量影像動態範圍；把相位 RMS 對基線的曲線、動態範圍與流量尺度寫入驗收紀錄，與前一次配置比較，差異超過預期者回頭查天線位置或線長補償。 驗證需要基準、重複性與允收準則。","explanationEn":"After a reconfiguration make a short observation of a strong quasar: check that closure phases on all triangles are zero, that each antenna's phase solution is continuous, then self-calibrate the same source and measure image dynamic range; enter the phase-RMS-versus-baseline curve, dynamic range and flux scale into the acceptance record, compare with the previous configuration, and trace any excess to antenna positions or line-length compensation. Verification needs a reference, repeatability and acceptance criteria."},"unit":8,"unitFacet":"verification","order":7,"sequence":31},{"id":"a494-v12-32","title":"天線整合、重組與陣列驗收：失效診斷","titleEn":"Antenna integration, reconfiguration and array acceptance: failure diagnosis","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-alma-about","v12o-alma-antennas","v12o-eso-alma","v12o-nrao-alma"],"prerequisiteIds":["a494-v12-31"],"objective":"從症狀倒推「陣列重組與系統驗收紀錄」的失效原因，提出能區分原因的檢查與矯正措施。","objectiveEn":"Work back from symptoms to the failure causes of “Array reconfiguration and system-acceptance record” and propose discriminating checks and corrective actions.","instruction":"一座天線在搬移後位置誤差 1 mm 未被重解，所有含該天線的基線相位隨時間緩慢旋轉；自校正會把誤差吸收進增益解而掩蓋問題，但目標源的位置會系統性偏移，直到有人比對校正源位置才發現。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整個系統的性能、良率或安全。","instructionEn":"An antenna whose position is off by 1 mm after a move and not re-solved makes every baseline containing it rotate slowly in phase; self-calibration absorbs the error into gain solutions and hides the problem, but target positions shift systematically until someone compares calibrator positions. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-system performance, yield or safety.","observation":"連結機制：陣列的驗收不是逐天線合格，而是以整體指標判定：相位穩定度對基線長度的關係、影像動態範圍、流量尺度一致性與可觀測時間比例，這些數字進入系統驗證紀錄並成為每個觀測週期的基準。","observationEn":"Link to the mechanism: The array is accepted not antenna by antenna but on system metrics: phase stability versus baseline length, image dynamic range, flux-scale consistency and the fraction of usable observing time, all recorded in the system-verification record that becomes the baseline for each observing cycle.","failure":"誤判風險：若相信「每座天線各自通過驗收，陣列就自動可以做科學觀測。」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。","failureEn":"Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"If every antenna passes its own acceptance, the array is automatically ready for science.\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.","check":"完成失效樹與矯正措施，並指出哪一項量測能最快確認根因、如何防止再發。","checkEn":"Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement that confirms the root cause fastest, and state how recurrence is prevented.","knowledge":[{"id":"a494-v12-32-k1","title":"失效模式","titleEn":"Failure mode","text":"一座天線在搬移後位置誤差 1 mm 未被重解，所有含該天線的基線相位隨時間緩慢旋轉；自校正會把誤差吸收進增益解而掩蓋問題，但目標源的位置會系統性偏移，直到有人比對校正源位置才發現。","textEn":"An antenna whose position is off by 1 mm after a move and not re-solved makes every baseline containing it rotate slowly in phase; self-calibration absorbs the error into gain solutions and hides the problem, but target positions shift systematically until someone compares calibrator positions.","sourceIds":["v12o-alma-about","v12o-alma-antennas","v12o-eso-alma","v12o-nrao-alma"]},{"id":"a494-v12-32-k2","title":"根因確認","titleEn":"Root-cause confirmation","text":"根因必須以可區分的量測確認；只更換零件或放寬參數可能掩蓋問題。","textEn":"Confirm the root cause with a discriminating measurement; merely swapping parts or relaxing limits can mask the problem.","sourceIds":["v12o-alma-about","v12o-alma-antennas","v12o-eso-alma","v12o-nrao-alma"]}],"quiz":{"question":"在「天線整合、重組與陣列驗收」出現異常時，下列哪一項判斷最合理？","questionEn":"When \"Antenna integration, reconfiguration and array acceptance\" misbehaves, which diagnosis is most reasonable?","options":["調高增益或放寬允收值，就能解決大多數異常。","只要天線夠大，站址高度對毫米波觀測影響不大。","一座天線在搬移後位置誤差 1 mm 未被重解，所有含該天線的基線相位隨時間緩慢旋轉。"],"optionsEn":["Raising the gain or widening the acceptance limits solves most anomalies.","With big enough antennas, site altitude hardly matters at millimetre wavelengths.","An antenna whose position is off by 1 mm after a move and not re-solved makes every baseline containing it rotate slowly in phase."],"answer":2,"explanation":"一座天線在搬移後位置誤差 1 mm 未被重解，所有含該天線的基線相位隨時間緩慢旋轉；自校正會把誤差吸收進增益解而掩蓋問題，但目標源的位置會系統性偏移，直到有人比對校正源位置才發現。 需以量測區分可能原因。","explanationEn":"An antenna whose position is off by 1 mm after a move and not re-solved makes every baseline containing it rotate slowly in phase; self-calibration absorbs the error into gain solutions and hides the problem, but target positions shift systematically until someone compares calibrator positions. Discriminate candidate causes by measurement."},"unit":8,"unitFacet":"failure","order":8,"sequence":32}],"order":4}],"sourceIds":["v12o-alma-about","v12o-alma-antennas","v12o-eso-alma","v12o-nrao-alma"],"curriculumVersion":12,"stepCount":32,"estimatedMinutes":800}};
